    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Nowe funkcje / Zawarto\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dodano obs\u0142ug\u0119 j\u0119zyka chi\u0144skiego tradycyjnego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Added Traditional Chinese language support."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.2
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.3
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Jako\u015B\u0107 \u017Cycia / Dost\u0119pno\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Lista j\u0119zyk\xF3w pokazuje teraz nazw\u0119 ka\u017Cdego
        j\u0119zyka w Twoim j\u0119zyku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Language list now shows each language's name in your own
        language."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.5
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.6
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Poprawki b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wyposa\u017Cone przedmioty w trakcie odnowienia nie duplikuj\u0105
        si\u0119 ju\u017C po przeniesieniu do magazynu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Equipped items on cooldown no longer duplicate when moved
        into storage."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono nie\u015Bmiertelno\u015B\u0107 statku po \u015Bmierci
        z otwartym panelem w trybie wieloosobowym."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed dying with a panel open in multiplayer leaving the
        ship immortal."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Zapisy dotkni\u0119te b\u0142\u0119dem nie\u015Bmiertelnego
        statku naprawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 przy nast\u0119pnym odrodzeniu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Saves affected by the immortal ship bug now recover on the
        next respawn."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nieu\u017Cyteczne nadmiarowe Szyfratory Bramy Skokowej z trybu
        wieloosobowego s\u0105 teraz usuwane automatycznie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Unusable extra Gateway Ciphers from multiplayer are now
        removed automatically."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.05.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Poprawiono szereg b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w w t\u0142umaczeniu na
        chi\u0144ski uproszczony."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed a number of mistranslations in the Simplified Chinese
        text."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Poprawki b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Opuszczenie doku odbudowuje teraz kolizje kad\u0142uba, dzi\u0119ki
        czemu statki bez tarczy mog\u0105 zbiera\u0107 przedmioty."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Undocking now rebuilds hull collision so shieldless ships
        can collect items."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d przy przejmowaniu starcia w kooperacji
        z przej\u0119tym statkiem."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error taking over a co-op encounter holding a mind-controlled
        ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d po przeniesieniu broni wi\u0105zkowej
        z lustrzanego slotu do zwyk\u0142ego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error after moving a mirrored beam weapon to an
        unmirrored slot."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d, gdy dron lub wie\u017Cyczka traci\u0142y
        cz\u0119\u015B\u0107 kad\u0142uba przy wstrzymanym czasie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when a drone or turret lost a hull part while
        time was paused."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.04.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d przy do\u0142\u0105czaniu do sesji,
        gdy host ko\u0144czy\u0142 starcie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error joining a session while the host completed
        an encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Poprawki b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Przekazanie hosta w kooperacji nie umieszcza ju\u017C statk\xF3w
        w z\u0142ej eskadrze po inwazji."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Co-op host handoffs no longer put ships in the wrong squadron
        post-invasion."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Projekty statk\xF3w ustalaj\u0105 teraz rozmiar tarczy przy
        zako\u0144czeniu edycji, co usuwa b\u0142\u0105d przy szybkim zamkni\u0119ciu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship designs now size the shield on Finish, fixing an error
        when closed fast."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naje\u017Ad\u017Acy nie rozprzestrzeniaj\u0105 si\u0119 ju\u017C
        na starcie, do kt\xF3rego skacze gracz w kooperacji."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Invaders no longer spread to an encounter a co-op player
        is jumping into."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Klawiatura ekranowa zamyka si\u0119 teraz razem z panelem przedmiotu,
        co usuwa b\u0142\u0105d przy anulowaniu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 On-screen keyboard now closes with its item panel, fixing
        an error on Cancel."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.03.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Kredyt\xF3w przechowywanych jako przedmiot nie mo\u017Cna ju\u017C
        odrzuci\u0107 ani wyrzuci\u0107."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Credits stored as an item can no longer be discarded or
        dropped."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Nowe funkcje / Zawarto\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gracze wersji demo i pe\u0142nej gry widz\u0105 teraz nawzajem
        swoje gry w trybie Tylko znajomi Steam."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo and full-game players can now see each other's Steam
        Friends Only games."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Do gier za zamkni\u0119tym portem routera mo\u017Cna teraz do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107
        z publicznej listy gier."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Games behind a closed router port can now be joined from
        the game list."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gry w wersji demo \u0142\u0105cz\u0105 si\u0119 teraz przez
        Steam, gdy obaj gracze maj\u0105 demo."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo games now connect through Steam when both players own
        the demo."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.4
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.5
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Jako\u015B\u0107 \u017Cycia / Dost\u0119pno\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 T\u0142umaczenie hiszpa\u0144skie zmieniono na neutralne dla
        Hiszpanii i Ameryki \u0141aci\u0144skiej."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Spanish translation revised to neutral Spanish for Spain
        and Latin America."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.7
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.8
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Poprawki b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Zaproszenia Steam przyj\u0119te przed wczytaniem menu nie pomijaj\u0105
        ju\u017C sprawdzania wersji."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Steam invites accepted before the menu loads no longer skip
        the version check."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Eskadry wrog\xF3w nie trac\u0105 ju\u017C statku, gdy gracz
        w kooperacji opuszcza starcie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy squadrons no longer lose a ship when a co-op player
        leaves an encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gry publiczne hostowane przez IPv6 trafiaj\u0105 teraz na publiczn\u0105
        list\u0119 gier i mo\u017Cna do nich do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Public games hosted over IPv6 are now listed and joinable
        from the game list."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.02.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d sterowania po wyj\u015Bciu z gry,
        gdy panel statku wci\u0105\u017C si\u0119 otwiera\u0142."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an input error after leaving a game with a ship panel
        still opening."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Jako\u015B\u0107 \u017Cycia / Dost\u0119pno\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 B\u0142\u0119dy niezgodno\u015Bci mod\xF3w wymieniaj\u0105 teraz
        brakuj\u0105ce, nadmiarowe i niezgodne wersje."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Mod mismatch errors now name the missing, extra or wrong-version
        mods."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Podpowiedzi na li\u015Bcie gier pokazuj\u0105 teraz mody hosta
        i oznaczaj\u0105 r\xF3\u017Cnice."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Game list tooltips now show the host's mods and flag any
        that differ."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.3
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.4
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Wydajno\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Performance</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dane walki w kooperacji s\u0105 znacznie mniejsze, co pomaga
        graczom ze s\u0142abszym \u0142\u0105czem."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Co-op combat data is now far smaller, helping players on
        weaker connections."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.6
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.7
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Poprawki b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gracze na Steam nie s\u0105 ju\u017C roz\u0142\u0105czani, gdy
        wolne \u0142\u0105cze na chwil\u0119 si\u0119 zatka."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Steam players are no longer dropped when a slow connection
        briefly backs up."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Muzyka nie zacina si\u0119 ju\u017C w wielkich walkach, bo limit
        g\u0142os\xF3w audio by\u0142 za niski."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Music no longer stutters in big fights, as the audio voice
        limit was too low."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Odleg\u0142e d\u017Awi\u0119ki milkn\u0105 teraz powy\u017Cej
        1,4 km, zamiast cicho si\u0119 utrzymywa\u0107."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Distant sounds now fade to silence beyond 1.4 km instead
        of lingering faintly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Suwaki g\u0142o\u015Bno\u015Bci dzia\u0142aj\u0105 teraz od
        uruchomienia, a nie po pierwszym zapisie ustawie\u0144."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Volume sliders now apply on launch instead of after the
        first settings save."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wie\u017Cyczki statk\xF3w AI wracaj\u0105 teraz do przodu, gdy
        strac\u0105 cel."
      baseValue: "\u2022 AI ship turrets now swing back forward once their target
        is gone."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Licznik wrog\xF3w na radarze nie zawiesza si\u0119 ju\u017C,
        gdy przej\u0119ty statek do\u0142\u0105cza do eskadry."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar enemy count no longer freezes when a converted ship
        joins a squadron."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wej\u015Bcie do starcia znajomego nie zostawia ju\u017C twojego
        statku bia\u0142ego i zablokowanego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Arriving in a friend's encounter no longer leaves your ship
        white and stuck."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.15
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pociski Dzia\u0142a grawitacyjnego wybuchaj\u0105 teraz na ko\u0144cu
        lotu, zamiast po prostu znika\u0107."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity Cannon shots now explode at the end of their flight,
        not just vanish."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.01.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Skok mi\u0119dzy starciami z Macierz\u0105 wirow\u0105 nie powoduje
        ju\u017C b\u0142\u0119du."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Jumping between encounters with a Vortex Array no longer
        causes an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.title
      type: 13
      value: Tryb wieloosobowy
      baseValue: Multiplayer
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Nowe funkcje / Zawarto\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gra online ze znajomymi: kooperacja dla maksymalnie 8 graczy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Play online with friends: co-op multiplayer for up to 8
        players."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Si\u0142a wrog\xF3w skaluje si\u0119 z liczb\u0105 graczy w
        sesji."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemies scale in strength with the number of players in
        the session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Do\u015Bwiadczenie za zab\xF3jstwa jest dzielone z graczami
        w tym samym starciu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Experience from kills is shared with players in the same
        encounter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Hostowanie sesji z nazw\u0105, opcjonalnym has\u0142em, limitem
        graczy i widoczno\u015Bci\u0105."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Host sessions with a name, optional password, player cap,
        and visibility."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wyszukiwanie gier przez publiczn\u0105 list\u0119 gier, sie\u0107
        LAN, znajomych Steam lub IP."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Find games via the public game list, LAN discovery, Steam
        friends, or IP."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Zaproszenie Steam przenosi od razu do sesji znajomego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Accept a Steam invite to jump straight into a friend's session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gry mo\u017Cna ustawi\u0107 na PVP / Wsp\xF3lny \u0142up wed\u0142ug
        uznania."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Games can be set to PVP / Shared Loot as desired."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Piloci hardkorowi i zwykli mog\u0105 gra\u0107 razem w tej samej
        sesji."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hardcore and Regular pilots can play together in the same
        session."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dodano czat tekstowy na HUD w grach wieloosobowych, z nowym
        przypisaniem klawisza."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Text chat added to HUD in multiplayer games with new keybinding
        to activate."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Lista graczy obok radaru pokazuje status i po\u0142o\u017Cenie
        pozosta\u0142ych graczy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Player list next to Radar shows other players' status and
        location."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Gdy host si\u0119 roz\u0142\u0105czy, gra p\u0142ynnie wraca
        do trybu jednoosobowego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 If the host disconnects the game seamlessly drops back into
        single player."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wersja demo ma pe\u0142ny tryb wieloosobowy i do\u0142\u0105cza
        do sesji pe\u0142nej gry w Sektorze 1."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo includes full multiplayer and can join full-game sessions
        in Sector 1."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dialogi w trybie wieloosobowym wstrzymuj\u0105 teraz starcie
        wszystkim podczas walki."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dialogs in multiplayer now pause the encounter for everyone
        during combat."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dialogi wieloosobowe przewijaj\u0105 si\u0119 same po czasie
        na przeczytanie, wi\u0119c nikt nie utknie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Multiplayer dialogs auto-advance on a reading timer so no
        one stays frozen."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.15
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Lista graczy pokazuje teraz, kt\xF3rzy gracze czytaj\u0105 dialog."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Player list now shows which players are reading a dialog."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nowe podpowiedzi na li\u015Bcie gier wieloosobowych pokazuj\u0105
        nazw\u0119, poziom i tryb gracza."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New multiplayer game list tooltips show each player's name,
        level, and mode."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Host mo\u017Ce teraz usuwa\u0107 lub banowa\u0107 graczy komendami
        /kick i /ban na czacie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hosts can now kick or ban players with the /kick and /ban
        chat commands."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.18
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.19
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Zmiany balansu</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Balance Changes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Koszt zwi\u0119kszania rzadko\u015Bci w Statku monta\u017Cowym
        zmniejszono o po\u0142ow\u0119."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Rarity upgrade costs in the Assembler have been halved."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Tw\xF3j statek nie mo\u017Ce ju\u017C zosta\u0107 zniszczony
        przy flocie, wi\u0119c odrodzenie jest zawsze bezpieczne."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Your ship can no longer be destroyed at the fleet, so respawns
        are always safe."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pochodnia kriogeniczna i Przew\xF3d kinetyczny s\u0105 teraz
        dost\u0119pne w sprzeda\u017Cy na statku-matce."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Cryo Torch and Kinetic Conduit are now available for sale
        in the mothership."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.23
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Zwi\u0119kszono pr\u0119dko\u015B\u0107 Kuli B\u0142yskawic
        Mj\xF6lnira o 40%."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Increased speed of Mj\xF6lnir's Lightning Orb by 40%."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.24
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Zmniejszono regeneracj\u0119 kad\u0142uba Gniazda l\u0119gowego
        Gatunku XI o 25%."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Reduced Hull Regen of Species-XI Broodnest by 25%."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.25
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.26
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Jako\u015B\u0107 \u017Cycia / Dost\u0119pno\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Quality of Life / Accessibility</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Zapisy z brakuj\u0105cymi modami wy\u015Bwietlaj\u0105 si\u0119
        teraz normalnie, pokazuj\u0105c, kt\xF3rych mod\xF3w brakuje."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Saves with missing mods now list normally, showing which
        mods are missing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Poprawiono gramatyk\u0119 i przejrzysto\u015B\u0107 opis\xF3w
        przedmiot\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Item descriptions have been corrected for grammar and clarity."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.29
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Ekran trybu wieloosobowego w demie wyja\u015Bnia teraz hostowanie
        i do\u0142\u0105czanie do gier w Sektorze 1."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Demo multiplayer screen now explains hosting and joining
        Sector 1 games."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.30
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dzia\u0142o grawitacyjne pokazuje teraz uwi\u0119\u017A do wszystkiego,
        co ci\u0105gnie, zanikaj\u0105c\u0105 z odleg\u0142o\u015Bci\u0105."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity Cannon now shows a tether to everything it pulls,
        fading with range."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.31
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.32
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Poprawki b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.33
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wspomaganie celowania dzia\u0142a teraz na statkach \u0142\u0105cz\u0105cych
        bro\u0144 centraln\u0105 i przesuni\u0119t\u0105 poza \u015Brodek."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Aim assist now works on ships mixing centered and off-center
        weapons."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.34
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wrogowie z dalszych sektor\xF3w przyspieszaj\u0105 teraz szybciej,
        zgodnie z wy\u017Csz\u0105 pr\u0119dko\u015Bci\u0105 maksymaln\u0105."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Later-sector enemies now accelerate faster to match their
        higher top speed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.35
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pr\u0119dko\u015B\u0107 maksymalna w Kompendium wrog\xF3w uwzgl\u0119dnia
        teraz w\u0142asne skalowanie pr\u0119dko\u015Bci wroga."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy Glossary max speed now includes each enemy's own speed
        scaling."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.36
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Granice frakcji na mapie galaktyki wch\u0142aniaj\u0105 teraz
        pojedyncze starcia frakcji obok nich."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Galaxy map faction borders now absorb lone faction encounters
        beside them."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.37
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d, gdy odbicia Os\u0142ony Tarczy niszczy\u0142y
        wrog\xF3w strzelaj\u0105cych wi\u0105zkami."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when Shield Ward reflections destroyed enemies
        firing beams."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.38
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Skoki silnika przemieszczeniowego i Czarnej Dziury nie umieszczaj\u0105
        ju\u017C du\u017Cych statk\xF3w w ciasnych szczelinach."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Displacement and Black Hole jumps no longer land big ships
        inside tight gaps."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.39
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pu\u0142apki elit i wyznaczanie tras wrog\xF3w uwzgl\u0119dniaj\u0105
        teraz prawdziwy rozmiar tarczy statku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Elite traps and enemy pathing now allow for each ship's
        true shield size."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.40
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Widoczno\u015B\u0107 we mgle, strza\u0142ki sensor\xF3w i odst\u0119py
        przy pojawianiu u\u017Cywaj\u0105 teraz prawdziwego rozmiaru statku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fog visibility, sensor arrows and spawn spacing now use
        true ship size."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.41
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Kopie Nap\u0119du holograficznego przejmuj\u0105 teraz wygl\u0105d
        legendarnych, sk\xF3rki i ukryte cz\u0119\u015Bci."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Holo Drive images now copy legendary looks, skins and hidden
        parts."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.42
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dysze silnik\xF3w ozdobnych znikaj\u0105 teraz razem ze statkiem
        podczas Przesuni\u0119cia fazowego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Vanity thruster nozzles now vanish with the ship during
        Phase Shift."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.43
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Promienie ciep\u0142a Zainfekowanego Cortexa celuj\u0105 teraz
        w cel, zamiast omiata\u0107 obok."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Infected Cortex heat rays now line up on the target instead
        of sweeping past."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.44
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Liczby przedmiot\xF3w zu\u017Cywalnych na HUD powy\u017Cej 99
        nie przechodz\u0105 ju\u017C do drugiej linii."
      baseValue: "\u2022 HUD consumable counts above 99 no longer wrap onto a second
        line."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.45
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Transportowce frakcji i Zainfekowany Cortex odblokowuj\u0105
        si\u0119 teraz w Kompendium."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Faction Transports and the Infected Cortex now unlock in
        the Glossary."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.46
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Szyfrator Bramy Skokowej i Klucz sektorowy odblokowuj\u0105
        si\u0119 w Kompendium po u\u017Cyciu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gateway Cipher and Sector Keystone now unlock in the Glossary
        once used."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.47
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wpisy Historii dialog\xF3w trafiaj\u0105 teraz do sektora, w
        kt\xF3rym je napotkano."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dialog History entries now file under the sector they were
        encountered in."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.48
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Sonda Szarak\xF3w pojawia si\u0119 teraz w Kompendium, gdy Szaraki
        zostan\u0105 ujawnione."
      baseValue: "\u2022 The Grays probe now appears in the Glossary once the Grays
        are revealed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.49
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105kaj\u0105cy si\u0119 kursor pozostaj\u0105cy
        w polach ilo\u015Bci po wpisaniu warto\u015Bci."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed a stray cursor lingering in amount entry boxes after
        typing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.50
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono klikni\u0119cie na ko\u0144cu efekt\xF3w d\u017Awi\u0119kowych
        Lasera spiralnego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed a clicking sound at the end of Spiral Laser sound
        effects."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.51
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Muzyka zmienia teraz utwory, gdy gra dzia\u0142a w tle poza
        pierwszym planem."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Music now changes tracks while the game runs unfocused in
        the background."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.52
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Muzyka zmienia teraz utwory dopiero po ustaniu walki, co usuwa
        pulsowanie przy flocie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Music now changes tracks only when combat settles, fixing
        pulses at the fleet."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.53
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 D\u017Awi\u0119ki broni uruchomione podczas Nap\u0119du czasowego
        zwalniaj\u0105 i wracaj\u0105 teraz poprawnie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Weapon sounds started during Temporal Drive now slow and
        restore correctly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.54
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Cz\u0119\u015Bci statk\xF3w trafione poza ekranem nie trac\u0105
        ju\u017C tekstury i nie bielej\u0105."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship parts hit off-screen no longer lose their texture and
        turn white."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.55
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Ikona wentylacji pokazuje teraz twoje ustawienie wentylacji,
        a nie wentylacj\u0119 wymuszon\u0105 strzelaniem."
      baseValue: "\u2022 The vent icon now shows your vent toggle, not vents forced
        open by firing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.56
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Silniki ozdobne przejmuj\u0105 teraz wygl\u0105d hipernap\u0119du,
        przemieszczenia i Nap\u0119du holograficznego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Vanity thrusters now take on hyperdrive, displacement and
        Holo Drive looks."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.57
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Starcia zawieraj\u0105 teraz najwy\u017Cej jedn\u0105 skrytk\u0119,
        zamiast czasem dw\xF3ch naraz."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Encounters now hold at most one cache instead of sometimes
        stacking two."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.58
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Legendarne skrytki zawsze upuszczaj\u0105 teraz legendarny przedmiot
        zamiast trzeciego rzadkiego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Legendary caches now always drop a legendary instead of
        a third rare item."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.59
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono brak ucieczki transportowc\xF3w Gatunku XI w starciach
        Przej\u0119cia."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed Species-XI transports not fleeing during intercept
        encounters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.60
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Hipernap\u0119d wymaga teraz pe\u0142nego czasu \u0142adowania,
        dop\xF3ki Gniazdo l\u0119gowe wci\u0105\u017C \u017Cyje."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Hyperdrive now takes the full charge time while a Broodnest
        is still alive."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.61
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.62
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Modderzy</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Modders</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.63
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Metody Overwrite/Revert materia\u0142u i koloru w Equippable
        s\u0105 teraz virtual."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Equippable material and color Overwrite/Revert methods are
        now virtual."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.96.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Wydajno\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Performance</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.96.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nowe ustawienie Jako\u015B\u0107 mg\u0142awicy oferuje szybsz\u0105
        mg\u0142\u0119 w jako\u015Bci \u015Aredniej i Niskiej dla starszych komputer\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Nebula Quality setting offers faster Medium and Low
        fog for older PCs."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
