    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.0
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Nowe funkcje / Zawarto\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nowy Hangar w Statku monta\u017Cowym mie\u015Bci do 10 projekt\xF3w
        statk\xF3w do wyboru."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Assembler Hangar Bay stores up to 10 ship designs you
        can switch between."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Resetowanie ulepsze\u0144 nie kosztuje ju\u017C kredyt\xF3w,
        wi\u0119c mo\u017Cna swobodnie eksperymentowa\u0107."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Resetting upgrades no longer costs credits, so feel free
        to experiment."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Kredyty mo\u017Cna teraz wp\u0142aca\u0107 do Lokalnego i Wsp\xF3\u0142dzielonego
        skarbca w Statku monta\u017Cowym."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Credits can now be deposited into Local and Shared Vaults
        at the Assembler."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Sektory zawieraj\u0105 teraz sta\u0142e skrytki z z g\xF3ry
        okre\u015Blonymi rzadkimi przedmiotami."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Sectors now include fixed caches that drop pre-defined rare
        items."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nowa bro\u0144 poboczna: Dzia\u0142o grawitacyjne przechwytuje
        szcz\u0105tki, rakiety i drony."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New secondary weapon: the Gravity Cannon captures debris,
        missiles and drones."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Lasery obrony punktowej oszcz\u0119dzaj\u0105 teraz ska\u0142y
        i drony, kt\xF3rych Dzia\u0142o grawitacyjne potrzebuje jako amunicji."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Point Defense Lasers spare rocks and drones your Gravity
        Cannon wants as ammo."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nowy przedmiot Transponder pozwala statkom obronnym biernie
        generowa\u0107 zagro\u017Cenie u wrog\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Transponder item allows tank builds to passively gain
        threat on enemies."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dodano nowy awatar gracza do wyboru przy tworzeniu pilota."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Added a new player avatar to choose from when creating a
        pilot."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.9
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
