    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Rozmiar statku zwielokrotnia teraz generowane zagro\u017Cenie,
        do x10 dla Pancernik\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship size now multiplies threat generated, up to x10 for
        Dreadnoughts."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Aureola naprawcza naprawia teraz tak\u017Ce twoje w\u0142asne
        drony i wie\u017Cyczki."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Repair Halo now also repairs your own drones and turrets."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Promie\u0144 naprawczy mo\u017Ce teraz naprawia\u0107 twoje
        w\u0142asne drony i wie\u017Cyczki, gdy jest w nie wycelowany."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Repair Ray can now repair your own drones and turrets when
        aimed at them."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.14
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
