    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nowe ustawienie d\u017Awi\u0119ku Motyw floty odtwarza g\u0142\xF3wny
        motyw w obecno\u015Bci floty."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Fleet Theme audio setting plays main theme while the
        fleet is present."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Domy\u015Blna odleg\u0142o\u015B\u0107 kamery daje teraz sp\xF3jny
        rozmiar statku na ka\u017Cdym ekranie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Default camera distance now targets a consistent ship size
        on any screen."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Ikony skrytek pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 teraz na odkrytych starciach,
        co u\u0142atwia planowanie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Cache icons now show on revealed encounters so you can plan
        ahead."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.19
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Panel nawigacyjny pokazuje teraz podgl\u0105d zawarto\u015Bci
        skrytki w starciu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Navigation panel now previews what an encounter's cache
        will drop."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Strony przedmiot\xF3w w Kompendium pokazuj\u0105 teraz, kt\xF3ra
        frakcja ma sta\u0142\u0105 skrytk\u0119 z danym przedmiotem."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Glossary item pages now list which faction holds a fixed
        cache for the item."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Statystyki klasy w Edytorze statku pokazuj\u0105 teraz nowe
        mno\u017Cniki zagro\u017Cenia."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Class stats in the ship designer now show the new threat
        multipliers."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Foldery preset\xF3w edytora statku sortuj\u0105 si\u0119 teraz
        alfabetycznie w twoim j\u0119zyku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship designer preset folders now sort alphabetically in
        your language."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.23
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.24
      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Poprawki b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Bug Fixes</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.25
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono szybkie stukanie broni\u0105 wi\u0105zkow\u0105,
        kt\xF3re zadawa\u0142o du\u017Co wi\u0119cej obra\u017Ce\u0144 ni\u017C przytrzymanie
        ognia."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed rapidly tapping beam weapons dealing far more damage
        than holding fire."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.26
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wrogie wi\u0105zki, p\u0142omienie Pochodni i wiruj\u0105ce
        dyski nie rysuj\u0105 si\u0119 ju\u017C pod twoim statkiem."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Enemy beams, torch flames and spinner discs no longer render
        under your ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Aury Aureoli \u015Bwiec\u0105 teraz za statkami, zamiast rysowa\u0107
        si\u0119 na pobliskich wrogach."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Halo auras now glow behind ships instead of drawing over
        nearby enemies."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Smugi Przesuni\u0119cia fazowego nie pozostaj\u0105 ju\u017C
        na zawsze, gdy statek ginie w trakcie fazy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Phase Shift trails no longer linger forever when a ship
        dies mid-phase."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.29
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pier\u015Bcienie ostrzegawcze op\xF3\u017Anionego strza\u0142u
        nie pozostaj\u0105 ju\u017C po przezbrojeniu w trakcie strza\u0142u."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Delayed-fire warning rings no longer stick around after
        a mid-shot refit."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.30
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Obrysy przyjaznych statk\xF3w renderuj\u0105 si\u0119 teraz
        w pe\u0142nej rozdzielczo\u015Bci, co usuwa pikselowate kraw\u0119dzie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Friendly ship outlines now render at full resolution to
        fix pixelated edges."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.31
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d, gdy czarna dziura powstawa\u0142a
        po zniszczeniu statku, kt\xF3ry j\u0105 wystrzeli\u0142."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when a black hole formed after its firing
        ship was destroyed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.32
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d przy u\u017Cyciu kapsu\u0142y w chwili
        \u015Bmierci eskadry lub przyjaznego statku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error using a capsule the moment a squadron or
        friendly ship died."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.33
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono ciemne obrysy pokazywane dla Kluczy Sektorowych jeszcze
        nieumieszczonych w bramie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed dark outlines showing for Sector Keystones not yet
        placed in a gateway."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.34
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wskakuj\u0105ce statki nie kieruj\u0105 ju\u017C przez chwil\u0119
        broni w z\u0142\u0105 stron\u0119."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ships jumping in no longer point their weapons the wrong
        way for a second."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.35
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Upuszczenie sprz\u0119tu na przedmiot z oferty handlarza nie
        powoduje ju\u017C b\u0142\u0119du."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Dropping equipment onto a trader's stock item no longer
        causes an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.36
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wizualizacje efekt\xF3w statusu nie staj\u0105 si\u0119 ju\u017C
        gigantyczne ani sp\u0142aszczone po wyskoczeniu statk\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Status effect visuals no longer become giant or squashed
        after ships jump out."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.37
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Efekty statusu nie unosz\u0105 si\u0119 ju\u017C nad statkiem
        w fazie lub ukrytym."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Status effects no longer appear floating over a phased or
        hidden ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.38
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 P\u0142omienie Po\u017Caru wygasaj\u0105 teraz naturalnie, zamiast
        urywa\u0107 si\u0119 nagle."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Burning flames now fade out naturally instead of being cut
        off abruptly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.39
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Oderwane cz\u0119\u015Bci nie pokazuj\u0105 ju\u017C wadliwych
        obrys\xF3w os\u0142abie\u0144 trwaj\u0105cych d\u0142u\u017Cej ni\u017C one
        same."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Blown-off parts no longer show glitchy debuff outlines that
        outlive them."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.40
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Struktury Klucza Osobliwo\u015Bci i odblokowane bramy nie trac\u0105
        ju\u017C swojego cienia."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Singularity Key structures and unlocked gateways no longer
        lose their shadow."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.41
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Efekty broni p\u0142omiennych, kriogenicznych i plazmowych nie
        blakn\u0105 ju\u017C do m\u0119tnych, ciemnych barw."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Flame, cryo and plasma weapon effects no longer fade to
        murky dark colors."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.42
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Mapa radaru pokazuje teraz starcia odkryte po uko\u0144czeniu
        bie\u017C\u0105cego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar map now shows encounters revealed when you complete
        your current one."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.43
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Przywo\u0142ane i eskortuj\u0105ce statki celuj\u0105 teraz
        razem z liderem, lec\u0105c w formacji."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Summoned and escort ships now aim with their leader when
        flying in formation."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.44
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0119dy powodowane przez fregaty wypuszczaj\u0105ce
        dym w starciach w mg\u0142awicy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed errors from frigates venting smoke in nebula encounters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.45
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono ukrywanie si\u0119 HUD po zamkni\u0119ciu nast\u0119puj\u0105cych
        po sobie komunikat\xF3w o b\u0142\u0119dach."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed the HUD staying hidden after dismissing back-to-back
        error messages."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.46
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Statki zniszczone w trakcie ataku nie oddaj\u0105 ju\u017C ostatniego
        strza\u0142u ani nie wywo\u0142uj\u0105 b\u0142\u0119du."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ships destroyed mid-attack no longer fire a final shot or
        trigger an error."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.47
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d, gdy odbite obra\u017Cenia niszczy\u0142y
        statek strzelaj\u0105cy broni\u0105 wi\u0105zkow\u0105."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when reflected damage destroyed a ship firing
        beam weapons."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.48
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Bronie w stylu miotacza ognia zmieniaj\u0105 wysoko\u015B\u0107
        d\u017Awi\u0119ku, by na\u0142o\u017Cone kopie nie brzmia\u0142y metalicznie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Flamethrower-style weapons vary sound pitch so stacked copies
        aren't metallic."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.49
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Bronie ci\u0105g\u0142ego ognia milkn\u0105 teraz przy przegrzaniu,
        skoro nic nie strzela."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Constant-fire weapons now go silent while overheated since
        nothing is firing."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.50
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Bramy do uko\u0144czonych star\u0107 z bossem nie pokazuj\u0105
        ju\u017C ostrze\u017Cenia \u201Enie ma ucieczki\u201D."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gateways to completed boss encounters no longer show the
        No Escape warning."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.51
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono znikanie przelotu statku na ekranie \u0142adowania,
        gdy gra si\u0119 zacina."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed the loading screen ship flyby vanishing when the game
        stutters."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.52
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pod\u015Bwietlenia terytori\xF3w frakcji nie przesuwaj\u0105
        si\u0119 ju\u017C przy zmianie widok\xF3w mapy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Faction territory highlights no longer drift out of place
        between map views."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.53
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Silniki ozdobne nie pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 ju\u017C jako sloty
        do wyposa\u017Cenia w panelach sprz\u0119tu."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Vanity thrusters no longer appear as equippable slots on
        equipment panels."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.54
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Zniszczone skrytki nie zachowuj\u0105 ju\u017C swoich ikon na
        mapie radaru i mapach nawigacyjnych."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Destroyed caches no longer keep their icons on the radar
        and Navigation maps."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.55
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Kopie Nap\u0119du holograficznego przejmuj\u0105 teraz typ obra\u017Ce\u0144
        twojej tarczy, a nie losowy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Holo Drive images now copy your shield's damage type instead
        of a random one."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.56
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Muzyka Gniazda l\u0119gowego nie gra ju\u017C w starciu po znikni\u0119ciu
        Gniazda l\u0119gowego."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Broodnest music no longer plays in an encounter after the
        Broodnest is gone."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.57
      type: 13
