    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os\u0142ona Tarczy blokuje teraz na kraw\u0119dzi ba\u0144ki
        nawet u\u017Cyta bez tarcz."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Shield Ward now blocks at the bubble edge even when used
        with shields down."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Os\u0142abienia nie przenikaj\u0105 ju\u017C przez aktywn\u0105
        Os\u0142on\u0119 Tarczy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Debuffs no longer pierce an active Shield Ward."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Cie\u0144 statku i obrysy statusu nie zdradzaj\u0105 ju\u017C
        statk\xF3w ukrytych Przesuni\u0119ciem fazowym."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship shadow and status outlines no longer reveal ships hidden
        by Phase Shift."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.19
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d, gdy wi\u0105zka lasera trafia\u0142a
        cel po zniszczeniu jej statku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error when a laser beam hit a target after its
        ship was destroyed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Czarne dziury nie przestaj\u0105 ju\u017C zadawa\u0107 obra\u017Ce\u0144,
        gdy ginie statek, kt\xF3ry je wystrzeli\u0142."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Black holes no longer stop dealing damage when the ship
        that fired them dies."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
