      type: 13
      value: "<color=#ffffff>Wydajno\u015B\u0107</color>"
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Performance</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Fizyka nadrabia teraz najwy\u017Cej 3 kroki na klatk\u0119,
        by zapobiec zacinaniu w du\u017Cych bitwach."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Physics now catches up at most 3 steps per frame to stop
        heavy-battle stutter."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Odczyt statystyk statku nie skanuje ju\u017C ca\u0142ego wyposa\u017Cenia,
        przyspieszaj\u0105c du\u017Ce zestawy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship stat lookups no longer rescan all equipment, speeding
        up big loadouts."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.19
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Obra\u017Cenia Po\u017Caru, Radioaktywno\u015Bci i Przebicia
        s\u0105 naliczane partiami, by odci\u0105\u017Cy\u0107 procesor."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Burning, Radioactive and Impaled damage ticks in batches
        to cut CPU load."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Bronie automatyczne wykorzystuj\u0105 przez chwil\u0119 ten
        sam test linii strza\u0142u zamiast co tykni\u0119cie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Auto-weapons reuse their line-of-fire check briefly instead
        of every tick."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Paski zdrowia i ikony statusu statk\xF3w s\u0105 wykorzystywane
        ponownie zamiast tworzone od nowa."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship health bars and status icons are reused instead of
        rebuilt each time."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nasiona pijawek s\u0105 teraz ograniczone do 30 w locie na statek;
        nadmiar leczy natychmiast."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Leech seeds now cap at 30 in flight per ship; extra leech
        heals instantly."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.23
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Studnie grawitacyjne rzadziej szukaj\u0105 cel\xF3w, ale nadal
        przyci\u0105gaj\u0105 co tykni\u0119cie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity wells scan for targets less often while still pulling
        every tick."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.24
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nak\u0142adaj\u0105ce si\u0119 studnie grawitacyjne \u0142\u0105cz\u0105
        si\u0119 teraz w jedn\u0105 z sumowanymi obra\u017Ceniami."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Overlapping gravity wells now merge into a single well with
        stacked damage."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.25
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Przechwytywanie blasku pomija kad\u0142uby statk\xF3w, asteroidy
        i kontenery, o po\u0142ow\u0119 zmniejszaj\u0105c liczb\u0119 wywo\u0142a\u0144
        rysowania."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Glow capture skips ship hulls, asteroids and containers,
        halving draw calls."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.26
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Renderowanie obrysu statku wykorzystuje ponownie stan grafiki
        zamiast resetowa\u0107 go dla ka\u017Cdej cz\u0119\u015Bci."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship outline rendering reuses graphics state instead of
        resetting per part."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.27
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wszystkie bronie automatyczne na statku dziel\u0105 jedno wyszukiwanie
        celu zamiast osobnych."
      baseValue: "\u2022 All auto-weapons on a ship share one target search instead
        of one each."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.28
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Testy tarcz dla wi\u0105zek i utrzymanie listy statk\xF3w nie
        przydzielaj\u0105 ju\u017C pami\u0119ci co tykni\u0119cie."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Beam shield checks and ship list upkeep no longer allocate
        memory each tick."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.29
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
