      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.31
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Maksymalne warto\u015Bci modyfikator\xF3w w Kompendium uwzgl\u0119dniaj\u0105
        wy\u017Csze limity Rzadkich i Legendarnych."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Glossary max modifier values now reflect the higher Rare
        and Legendary caps."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.32
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Mapy gwiazd na radarze i w nawigacji nie r\xF3\u017Cni\u0105
        si\u0119 ju\u017C co do gwiazd z \u0142upem."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar and Navigation star maps no longer disagree on which
        stars hold loot."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.33
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono b\u0142\u0105d po zniszczeniu przej\u0119tego dow\xF3dcy
        eskadry."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error after a mind-controlled squadron leader was
        destroyed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.34
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Naprawiono rakiety Tornado zygzakuj\u0105ce po wystrzeleniu
        przez wolne t\u0142umienie sterowania."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed Tornado missiles zigzagging at launch due to slow
        steering damping."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.35
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Lasery obrony punktowej nie namierzaj\u0105 ju\u017C nieszkodliwych
        rakiet po odej\u015Bciu sojusznik\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Point Defense Lasers no longer target harmless missiles
        from departed allies."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.36
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Cofnij po wczytaniu szablonu lub imporcie przywraca teraz tw\xF3j
        poprzedni statek."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Undo after loading a template or import now restores your
        previous ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.37
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Lista cz\u0119\u015Bci w Edytorze statku nie otwiera si\u0119
        ju\u017C przewini\u0119ta do po\u0142owy."
      baseValue: "\u2022 The Ship Builder parts list no longer opens scrolled partway
        along."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.38
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Wyb\xF3r padem nie zaznacza ju\u017C element\xF3w listy przewini\u0119tych
        poza widok."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Controller selection no longer picks list items scrolled
        out of view."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.39
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Studnie grawitacyjne i czarne dziury nie odrzucaj\u0105 ju\u017C
        segment\xF3w w\u0119\u017Cowych wrog\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity wells and black holes no longer send snake enemy
        segments flying."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.40
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Segmenty w\u0119\u017Cowych wrog\xF3w nie rozje\u017Cd\u017Caj\u0105
        si\u0119 ju\u017C, gdy w walce jest wiele statk\xF3w."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Snake enemy segments no longer drift apart when many ships
        are in the fight."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.41
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Pier\u015Bcienie slot\xF3w silnik\xF3w w Edytorze statku s\u0105
        teraz nad kad\u0142ubem, a nie pod nim."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship Builder thruster slot rings now show above the hull
        instead of under it."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.42
      type: 13
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.43
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>Modderzy</color>
      baseValue: <color=#ffffff>Modders</color>
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.44
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 SceneGlowFeature.RegisterLine dodaje w\u0142asne emitery linii
        do przechwytywania blasku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 SceneGlowFeature.RegisterLine adds custom line emitters
        to the glow capture."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.45
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Nowe publiczne metody pomocnicze AIController.IsFormationSlaved
        i GravityWell.TryMerge."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New AIController.IsFormationSlaved and GravityWell.TryMerge
        public helpers."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.46
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 SceneGlowFeature.ExcludeRenderer wy\u0142\u0105cza sprite'y
        LDR z przechwytywania blasku."
      baseValue: "\u2022 SceneGlowFeature.ExcludeRenderer opts LDR sprites out of
        the glow capture."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.0
      type: 9
      value: Ulepszenia wizualne
      baseValue: Visual Improvements
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.1.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Efekty pocisk\xF3w"
      baseValue: Projectile Effects
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.1.description
      type: 9
      value: "Ulepszono efekty wizualne cz\u0105steczek i trafie\u0144, aby korzystanie
        z broni by\u0142o bardziej satysfakcjonuj\u0105ce."
      baseValue: Improve the visual effects of particles and hit effects so weapons
        are more satisfying to use.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.2
      type: 9
      value: "R\xF3\u017Cnorodno\u015B\u0107 build\xF3w"
      baseValue: Build Diversity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.3.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "\u0141amacz limit\xF3w"
      baseValue: Limit Breaker
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.3.description
      type: 9
      value: "Zlikwidowano limit 4 slot\xF3w na typy slot\xF3w, co pozwala projektom
        statk\xF3w na posiadanie dowolnej liczby slot\xF3w podstawowych, drugorz\u0119dnych,
        specjalnych lub automatycznych specjalnych."
      baseValue: Remove the 4 slot limit on slot types allowing ship designs to have
        any number of primary, secondary, special or auto special slots.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.4.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Modernizacja ulepsze\u0144"
      baseValue: Upgrade Overhaul
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.4.description
      type: 9
      value: "Przeprojektowano drzewko ulepsze\u0144, aby umo\u017Cliwi\u0107 r\xF3\u017Cne
        style gry i zwi\u0119kszy\u0107 swobod\u0119. Dodano wsparcie dla bardziej
        wytrzyma\u0142ych build\xF3w i szybszych statk\xF3w."
      baseValue: Rework the upgrade tree to allow for different play styles and more
        freedom. Adding support for tankier builds and faster ships.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.5.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Klasy poboczne
      baseValue: Secondary Classes
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.5.description
      type: 9
      value: "Dodanie szerokiej gamy klas pobocznych, z kt\xF3rych ka\u017Cda zbudowana
        jest wok\xF3\u0142 odr\u0119bnego stylu gry z silnymi specjalizacjami w okre\u015Blonych
        typach obra\u017Ce\u0144."
      baseValue: Add a wide range of secondary classes, each built around distinct
        playstyles with strong damage type specialisations.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.6.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Walka wr\u0119cz"
      baseValue: Close Combat
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.6.description
      type: 9
      value: "Dodanie nowej klasy pobocznej do walki wr\u0119cz wraz z broni\u0105
        typu kosa i halo (aura)."
      baseValue: Add a new close combat secondary class along with scythe and halo
        (aura) weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.7
      type: 9
      value: Sektor 4
      baseValue: Sector 4
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.8.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Bro\u0144 osiowa"
      baseValue: Spinal Weapons
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.8.description
      type: 9
      value: "Przybywaj\u0105c w Sektorze 4, ta sta\u0142a bro\u0144 wymienia elastyczno\u015B\u0107
        na czyst\u0105 moc. Spodziewaj si\u0119 pot\u0119\u017Cnych przebijaj\u0105cych
        laser\xF3w i ogromnych pocisk\xF3w."
      baseValue: Arriving in Sector 4, these fixed weapons trade flexibility for
        raw power. Expect massive piercing lasers and oversized projectiles.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Sektor 4 - Faza 1
      baseValue: Sector 4 - Phase 1
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.description
      type: 9
      value: "Powr\xF3\u0107 do domu w Sektorze 4 (Poziom 45 - 50) i bro\u0144 Ziemi
        przed nasilaj\u0105cymi si\u0119 najazdami Gatunku-XI i Skeran, podczas gdy
        Echo ko\u0144czy pierwszy etap swojej broni."
      baseValue: Return home to Sector 4 (Level 45 - 50) and defend Earth against
        escalating Species-XI and Skeran incursions while Echo completes the first
        stage of her weapon.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.10.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Sektor 4 - Faza 2
      baseValue: Sector 4 - Phase 2
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.10.description
      type: 9
      value: "Kontynuuj walk\u0119 w Sektorze 4 (Poziom 50 - 55), gdy si\u0142y Phantom
        do\u0142\u0105czaj\u0105 do ataku, a Echo ko\u0144czy drugi etap swojej broni."
      baseValue: Continue the fight in Sector 4 (Level 50 - 55) as Phantoms forces
        join the assault while Echo completes the second stage of her weapon.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.11.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Sektor 4 - Faza 3
      baseValue: Sector 4 - Phase 3
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.11.description
      type: 9
      value: "Zako\u0144cz obron\u0119 Ziemi (Poziom 55 - 60), aktywuj bro\u0144
        i sta\u0144 naprzeciw swojego prawdziwego wroga. Odkryj nieoczekiwanych sojusznik\xF3w
        w zako\u0144czeniu fabu\u0142y gry."
      baseValue: Finish the defence of Earth (Level 55 - 60), activate the weapon,
        and face your true enemy. Discover unlikely allies in the conclusion of the
        game's storyline.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.12
      type: 9
      value: "Systemy ko\u0144ca gry"
      baseValue: End Game Systems
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.13.subheader
      type: 9
      value: New Game+
      baseValue: New Game+
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: roadmap.13.description
      type: 9
      value: "Rozpocznij gr\u0119 od nowa od Sektora 1 na wy\u017Cszym poziomie,
        z trudniejszymi wrogami, gro\u017Aniejszymi starciami i wi\u0119kszymi nagrodami."
      baseValue: Restart the game from Sector 1 at a higher level, with tougher enemies,
        deadlier encounters, and increased rewards.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.14.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Szczeliny Pustki
      baseValue: Void Rifts
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.14.description
      type: 9
      value: "Zyskaj dost\u0119p do samej Pustki, kszta\u0142tuj\u0105c starcia o
        rosn\u0105cej trudno\u015Bci. Nieko\u0144cz\u0105ce si\u0119 wyzwanie dla
        najsilniejszych pilot\xF3w."
      baseValue: Gain access to the Void itself, shaping encounters with escalating
        difficulty. An endless challenge for the strongest pilots.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.15.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Bro\u0144 artefaktowa"
      baseValue: Artifact Weapons
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.15.description
      type: 9
      value: "Nowa rzadko\u015B\u0107 broni ponad Legendarn\u0105, znajdowana wy\u0142\u0105cznie
        w Pustce."
      baseValue: A new weapon rarity above Legendary, found exclusively within the
        Void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.16
      type: 9
      value: "Dodatkowa zawarto\u015B\u0107"
      baseValue: Extra Content
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.17.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Mg\u0142awice"
      baseValue: Nebulas
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.17.description
      type: 9
      value: "Walcz wewn\u0105trz g\u0119stych mg\u0142awic, gdzie widoczno\u015B\u0107
        jest ograniczona, a wrogowie czyhaj\u0105 w zasadzce."
      baseValue: Fight within dense nebulas where visibility is reduced and enemies
        lie in wait.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.18.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Gniazda l\u0119gowe"
      baseValue: Broodnests
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.18.description
      type: 9
      value: "Elitarni wrogowie Gatunku-XI, kt\xF3rzy mog\u0105 pojawi\u0107 si\u0119
        nieoczekiwanie. Atakuj\u0105c z zasadzki w \u015Brodku walki, eskaluj\u0105c
        chaos i zmuszaj\u0105c do szybkiego dostosowania."
      baseValue: Elite Species-XI enemies that can emerge unexpectedly. Ambushing
        mid-fight, escalating chaos and forcing you to adapt quickly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.19.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Starcia obl\u0119\u017Cnicze"
      baseValue: Siege Encounters
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.19.description
      type: 9
      value: "Szturmuj wrogie stacje kosmiczne w nowym typie star\u0107 na wielk\u0105
        skal\u0119."
      baseValue: Assault enemy space stations in a new large-scale encounter type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.20.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Przebiegi symulacyjne
      baseValue: Simulation Runs
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.20.description
      type: 9
      value: "Testuj buildy i bro\u0144 w holopok\u0142adzie Statku-matki bez ryzyka
        i koszt\xF3w."
      baseValue: "Test builds and weapons in the Mothership\u2019s holodeck without
        risk or cost."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.21
      type: 9
      value: Dodatkowe systemy
      baseValue: Additional Systems
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.22.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Kompendium
      baseValue: Glossary
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.22.description
      type: 9
      value: "Kompletny przewodnik po ka\u017Cdym przedmiocie, legendzie, statku
        i frakcji w galaktyce. Odblokowuj\u0105cy nowe wpisy w miar\u0119 ich napotykania."
      baseValue: A complete reference of every item, legendary, ship and faction
        in the galaxy. Unlocking new entries as you encounter them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.23.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Nagrody za wrog\xF3w"
      baseValue: Enemy Bounties
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.23.description
      type: 9
      value: "Poluj na pot\u0119\u017Cne cele dla dodatkowych nagr\xF3d w miar\u0119
        post\u0119p\xF3w w fabule."
      baseValue: Hunt down powerful targets for bonus rewards as you progress through
        the story.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.24.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Przystawki do broni
      baseValue: Weapon Attachments
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.24.description
      type: 9
      value: "Dostosuj bro\u0144 jeszcze bardziej, montuj\u0105c przystawki zmieniaj\u0105ce
        jej dzia\u0142anie."
      baseValue: Further customise weapons by fitting attachments that alter their
        behaviour.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.25.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Statki najemnik\xF3w"
      baseValue: Mercenary Ships
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.25.description
      type: 9
      value: "Rekrutuj sta\u0142ych towarzyszy, projektuj ich statki i wyposa\u017Caj
        ich w bro\u0144, by walczyli u twego boku."
      baseValue: Recruit permanent companions, design their ships, and equip them
        with weapons to fight alongside you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.26
      type: 9
      value: "Wsparcie mod\xF3w"
      baseValue: Mod Support
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.27.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Mody + Warsztat Steam
      baseValue: Mods + Steam Workshop
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.27.description
      type: 9
      value: "Umo\u017Cliwienie do\u0142\u0105czania modyfikacji tworzonych przez
        graczy oraz wsparcie dla ich udost\u0119pniania przez Warsztat Steam."
      baseValue: Allow for the inclusion of player made modifications and support
        for sharing them through the Steam Workshop.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.28
      type: 9
      value: Tryb wieloosobowy
      baseValue: Multiplayer
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.29.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Tryb wieloosobowy online
      baseValue: Online Multiplayer
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.29.description
      type: 9
      value: "Po\u0142\u0105cz si\u0142y z przyjaci\xF3\u0142mi w trybie kooperacji
        lub sprawd\u017A swoje buildy przeciw innym graczom w PVP."
      baseValue: Team up with friends in co-op or test your builds against other
        players in PVP.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
