        i trwaj\u0105cego rozwoju, a realizacja poszczeg\xF3lnych element\xF3w nie
        jest gwarantowana w podanej kolejno\u015Bci."
      baseValue: This roadmap outlines my current plans and priorities. Features
        and timing may change based on player feedback and ongoing development, and
        items are not guaranteed to be completed in the order shown.
      context: 
