  - categoryName: Scene.Main.Extras Canvas
    entries:
    - key: 0cm8nhhq
      type: 16
      value: "Dzi\u0119kuj\u0119 za zakup Star Vortex. Tworz\u0119 t\u0119 gr\u0119
        sam, w wolnym czasie, i Twoje wsparcie wiele dla mnie znaczy.\r\n\r\n<b>Czego
        obecnie brakuje?</b>\r\n<color=#89bcde>\r\n\u2022 Sektor 4, zako\u0144czenie
        g\u0142\xF3wnej fabu\u0142y.\r\n\u2022 Fina\u0142owa ko\u0144c\xF3wka gry,
        w kt\xF3rej wchodzisz do Pustki.\r\n\u2022 Starcia obl\u0119\u017Cnicze,
        w kt\xF3rych walczysz ze stacjami kosmicznymi.\r\n\u2022 Mn\xF3stwo legendarnych
        broni i wariant\xF3w.\r</color>\r\n\r\nAktualizacje pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119
        co kilka tygodni, z now\u0105 zawarto\u015Bci\u0105 i usprawnieniami. Masz
        uwagi, sugestie lub zg\u0142oszenia b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w? Wrzu\u0107 je na
        kana\u0142 #feedback na naszym Discordzie!\r\n\r\nJeszcze raz dzi\u0119ki,
        mi\u0142ej gry!"
      baseValue: "Thanks for picking up Star Vortex. I'm developing the game as a
        solo developer in my spare time, and your support means a lot.\r\n\r\n<b>What's
        currently missing?</b>\r\n<color=#89bcde>\r\n\u2022 Sector 4, conclusion
        of the main story.\r\n\u2022 Final end-game where you enter the void.\r\n\u2022
        Siege Encounters where you fight space stations.\r\n\u2022 Lots of legendary
        weapons and variants.\r</color>\r\n\r\nUpdates land every few weeks with
        new content and improvements. Got feedback, suggestions, or bug reports?
        Drop them in the #feedback channel on our Discord!\r\n\r\nThanks again, enjoy
        the game!"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: kZVs20Ft
      type: 9
      value: "Zobacz plany Wczesnego Dost\u0119pu"
      baseValue: View Early Access Roadmap
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: MW1ZaFJf
      type: 16
      value: "Witamy w wersji demonstracyjnej Star Vortex. Je\u015Bli masz jakie\u015B
        uwagi, sugestie lub zg\u0142oszenia b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w, do\u0142\u0105cz
        do nas na Discordzie i daj mi zna\u0107.\n\nWersja demonstracyjna zawiera
        ca\u0142\u0105 zawarto\u015B\u0107 gry a\u017C do ko\u0144ca pierwszego sektora,
        czyli do oko\u0142o 20. poziomu. Pe\u0142na wersja gry zawiera dodatkowe
        sektory, bro\u0144, rasy, cz\u0119\u015Bci statk\xF3w i wiele wi\u0119cej.\n\nStar
        Vortex stworzy\u0142em <b>sam,</b> w wolnym czasie. Dzi\u0119ki za gr\u0119!"
      baseValue: 'Welcome to demo version of Star Vortex. If you have any feedback,
        suggestions or bug reports please join us on Discord and let me know.


        This
        demo includes all the content of the game up until the end of the first Sector
        which is around about level 20. The full game has additional sectors, weapons,
        races, ship parts and much more.


        Star Vortex is made by myself
        <b>a solo-developer</b> in my free time. Thanks for playing!'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
