    - key: drpH9oBF
      type: 9
      value: "Prywatno\u015B\u0107 i analiza danych"
      baseValue: Privacy and Analytics
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jE1FAU9n
      type: 8
      value: "Aby ulepszy\u0107 nasz\u0105 gr\u0119, chcieliby\u015Bmy zbiera\u0107
        anonimowe statystyki i dane dotycz\u0105ce sesji gry, post\u0119p\xF3w, awarii
        i wydajno\u015Bci.\n\nWi\u0105\u017Ce si\u0119 to z korzystaniem z us\u0142ugi
        strony trzeciej o nazwie \u201EUnity Analytics\u201D. Wszystkie dane s\u0105
        przesy\u0142ane anonimowo i nie mo\u017Cna ich powi\u0105za\u0107 z u\u017Cytkownikiem.\n\nNasz\u0105
        polityk\u0119 prywatno\u015Bci mo\u017Cna znale\u017A\u0107 pod adresem:
        <color=#89bcde>https://huntedcow.com/privacy-policy/</color>.\n\nMo\u017Cesz
        to w\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 lub wy\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 w dowolnym momencie
        w zak\u0142adce Ustawienia zaawansowane."
      baseValue: 'To improve our game, we would like to collect anonymized statistics
        and data about your play sessions, progress, crashes and performance.


        This
        involves using a third-party service called "Unity Analytics". All data is
        sent anonymously and cannot be traced back to you.


        Our privacy
        policy can be found at: <color=#89bcde>https://huntedcow.com/privacy-policy/</color>


        You
        can enable or disable this at any time under the Advanced Settings tab.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: AMLLy4mq
      type: 9
      value: "Nie wysy\u0142aj"
      baseValue: Do Not Send
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: b7PYrOq6
      type: 9
      value: "Przesy\u0142aj dane"
      baseValue: Send Data
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GZLozQXD
      type: 9
      value: Informacje o demie
      baseValue: Demo Information
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EkEE1zgi
      type: 8
      value: "Grasz w <color=#89bcde>wersj\u0119 demonstracyjn\u0105</color> gry
        Star Vortex. \n\nChocia\u017C ta wersja jest aktualizowana o wszystkie najnowsze
        funkcje, <color=#89bcde>nie b\u0119dziesz m\xF3g\u0142 przej\u015B\u0107
        dalej ni\u017C koniec sektora 1 (z 4)</color>. Jednak <b>wszelkie post\u0119py
        zostan\u0105 przeniesione do pe\u0142nej wersji gry</b> po jej wydaniu.\n\nPe\u0142na
        wersja gry jest ju\u017C dost\u0119pna w ramach wczesnego dost\u0119pu, wi\u0119c
        je\u015Bli chcesz j\u0105 wypr\xF3bowa\u0107, mo\u017Cesz to zrobi\u0107!\n\n<color=#89bcde>Gracze
        korzystaj\u0105cy z platformy Steam nie otrzymaj\u0105 \u017Cadnych osi\u0105gni\u0119\u0107
        w Steam. Zostan\u0105 one jednak przyznane z moc\u0105 wsteczn\u0105 w pe\u0142nej
        wersji gry!</color>"
      baseValue: "You're playing the <color=#89bcde>Demo</color> of Star Vortex.
        \n\nAlthough this version is kept up to date with all the latest features
        <color=#89bcde>you will not be able to proceed past the end of Sector 1</color>.
        However, <b>any progress you make will transfer to the full game</b> when
        it is released.\n\nThe full game is out in Early Access now so if you want
        to try it out you can!\n\n<color=#89bcde>Steam players wont be awarded any
        achievements in Steam. They'll be retro-actively awarded in the full game
        though!</color>"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ALDKgoUc
      type: 9
      value: "Wersja przegl\u0105darki"
      baseValue: Browser Version
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: k80TWFDG
      type: 8
      value: "Grasz w <color=#89bcde>Wersj\u0119 demonstracyjn\u0105 przegl\u0105darki</color>
        Star Vortex.\n\nChocia\u017C w tej wersji rozgrywka trwa wiele godzin, <color=#89bcde>nie
        b\u0119dziesz w stanie przej\u015B\u0107 dalej ni\u017C koniec Sektora 1</color>.\n\nPe\u0142na
        wersja gry jest ju\u017C dost\u0119pna we wczesnym dost\u0119pie, wi\u0119c
        je\u015Bli chcesz j\u0105 wypr\xF3bowa\u0107, znajdziesz j\u0105 na platformie
        Steam lub w sklepie Epic."
      baseValue: "You're playing the <color=#89bcde>Browser Demo</color> of Star
        Vortex. \n\nAlthough there are hours of gameplay in this version <color=#89bcde>you
        will not be able to proceed past the end of Sector 1</color>.\n\nThe full
        game is out in Early Access now so if you want to try it out you can find
        it on Steam or the Epic store."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SfiZVcmg
      type: 9
      value: "Wczesny dost\u0119p"
      baseValue: Early Access
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PmNCh8qJ
      type: 8
      value: "Dzi\u0119ki za wybranie <color=#89bcde>Star Vortex</color>! Tworz\u0119
        gr\u0119 jako samodzielny deweloper w wolnym czasie, a dotarcie do tego punktu
        by\u0142o szalon\u0105 jazd\u0105.\n\n<b>Historia ko\u0144czy si\u0119 obecnie
        po Sektorze 3</b>, ale wi\u0119cej zawarto\u015Bci jest ju\u017C w przygotowaniu.
        Je\u015Bli znalaz\u0142e\u015B b\u0142\u0105d, co\u015B ci si\u0119 nie podoba
        lub masz pomys\u0142 na ulepszenie gry, ch\u0119tnie o tym us\u0142ysz\u0119.
        Mo\u017Cesz przes\u0142a\u0107 swoj\u0105 opini\u0119 na naszym Discordzie.\n\nMi\u0142ej
        gry i jeszcze raz dzi\u0119ki za wsparcie!"
      baseValue: 'Thanks for picking up <color=#89bcde>Star Vortex</color>! I''m
        developing the game as a solo developer in my spare time and getting to this
        point has been a wild ride.


        The <b>story currently ends after Sector
        3</b> with more content already in the pipeline. If you hit a bug, something
        feels off, or you''ve got an idea to improve the game, I''d love to hear
        it. You can drop your feedback in our Discord.


        Enjoy the game,
        and thanks again for the support!'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qCHINMmm
      type: 9
      value: "Roadmapa Wczesnego Dost\u0119pu"
      baseValue: Early Access Roadmap
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
