  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Demo End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: kavk7l86
      type: 9
      value: "Uko\u0144czono demo"
      baseValue: Demo Complete
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Sp3qc7xG
      type: 8
      value: "Gratulacje, uko\u0144czy\u0142e\u015B wersj\u0119 demo!\n\n<color=#89bcde>Pe\u0142na
        wersja gry jest ju\u017C dost\u0119pna w ramach wczesnego dost\u0119pu! Niezale\u017Cnie
        od tego, czy j\u0105 kupisz, czy nie, ch\u0119tnie poznam Twoj\u0105 opini\u0119
        na temat wersji demo na naszym Discordzie.</color>\n\n<color=#5776a0>Zapisy
        gracza zostan\u0105 przeniesione do pe\u0142nej wersji gry, wi\u0119c mo\u017Cesz
        kontynuowa\u0107 swoj\u0105 przygod\u0119.</color>"
      baseValue: 'Congrats, you have completed the demo!


        <color=#89bcde>The
        full game is now out in Early Access! Whether you grab it or not, I''d love
        to hear what you thought of the demo in our Discord.</color>


        <color=#5776a0>Player
        saves will transfer to the full game so your adventure can continue.</color>'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 5dynyIZW
      type: 9
      value: "Wy\u015Bwietl stron\u0119 sklepu"
      baseValue: View Store Page
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Early Access End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: sd1yGGyy
      type: 9
      value: "Wczesny dost\u0119p: historia w toku"
      baseValue: 'Early Access: Story In Progress'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: M2TRKJpM
      type: 8
      value: "Post\u0119p fabu\u0142y wstrzymany... na razie.\n\nDotar\u0142e\u015B
        do obecnego limitu tre\u015Bci fabularnych w Early Access. Kolejne elementy
        fabu\u0142y i systemy s\u0105 w przygotowaniu.\n\nMo\u017Cesz kontynuowa\u0107
        rozgrywk\u0119 w trybie <color=#FB6330>Nowa Gra+</color>, resetuj\u0105c
        misje i wracaj\u0105c do Sektora 1 na wy\u017Cszym poziomie, zachowuj\u0105c
        sw\xF3j statek, ulepszenia i przedmioty."
      baseValue: 'Story progression paused... for now.


        You''ve reached
        the current limit of story content in Early Access. More story and systems
        are in development.


        You can continue playing in <color=#FB6330>New
        Game+</color>, resetting missions and returning to Sector 1 at a higher level
        while keeping your ship, upgrades, and items.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: WBmB4joN
      type: 8
      value: "New Game+ jest opcjonalne. Po rozpocz\u0119ciu ten wyb\xF3r jest trwa\u0142y
        i nie mo\u017Cna wr\xF3ci\u0107 do tego poziomu."
      baseValue: New Game+ is optional. Once started, this choice is permanent and
        you cannot return to this level.
      context: 
