  - categoryName: Scene.Game.HUD Tutorial Helper
    entries:
    - key: OG7Lffb1
      type: 18
      value: "Mo\u017Cesz u\u017Cy\u0107 promienia przyci\u0105gaj\u0105cego, by
        przyci\u0105gn\u0105\u0107 do siebie pobliskie pojemniki."
      baseValue: You can use your tractor beam to pull in nearby item containers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D4tpv9Eg
      type: 18
      value: "Mo\u017Cesz skr\u0119ca\u0107, przyspiesza\u0107 i stabilizowa\u0107
        sw\xF3j statek, u\u017Cywaj\u0105c poni\u017Cszych przycisk\xF3w."
      baseValue: You can turn, accelerate and stabilize your ship using the controls
        below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GgnYo5Si
      type: 18
      value: "Przytrzymaj przycisk uniku i dowolny przycisk kierunku, by wykona\u0107
        unik i wymin\u0105\u0107 wrog\xF3w."
      baseValue: Hold the dodge key and press any direction to dodge and avoid enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8ksGCocz
      type: 18
      value: "Przytrzymaj modyfikator uniku i le\u0107 w wybran\u0105 stron\u0119,
        by wykona\u0107 w t\u0119 stron\u0119 unik."
      baseValue: Hold down the dodge modifier and move in a direction to dodge that
        way.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 40aaJoXo
      type: 18
      value: "U\u017Cyj przycisku do\u0142adowania, je\u015Bli musisz pr\u0119dko
        si\u0119 gdzie\u015B dosta\u0107."
      baseValue: Use the boost button if you need to get somewhere quickly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A3xhd830
      type: 18
      value: "G\u0142\xF3wna bro\u0144 generuje ciep\u0142o, gdy jest u\u017Cywana.
        Je\u015Bli j\u0105 przegrzejesz - zostanie wy\u0142\u0105czona."
      baseValue: Primary weapons generate heat when used, overheating will disable
        them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8yy9WQ8e
      type: 18
      value: "W\u0142\u0105cz tryb wie\u017Cyczek, by celowa\u0107 broni\u0105 niezale\u017Cnie
        od ruchu statku."
      baseValue: Toggle turret mode to aim your weapons independently from your ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qjFmgpCP
      type: 18
      value: "Mo\u017Cesz celowa\u0107 niezale\u017Cnie od ruchu statku, u\u017Cywaj\u0105c
        poni\u017Cszych przycisk\xF3w."
      baseValue: You can aim separately from your ship using the controls below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YOcC3mqm
      type: 18
      value: "G\u0142\xF3wny panel zawiera ulepszenia, wyposa\u017Cenie, misje i
        narz\u0119dzia do nawigacji."
      baseValue: The core panel contains upgrades, equipment, missions and navigation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D8bNqsfe
      type: 18
      value: "Zestrzel jedn\u0105 z pobliskich asteroid, by po\u0107wiczy\u0107 celno\u015B\u0107."
      baseValue: Shoot one of the nearby asteroids for target practice.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: mtEKYWW3
      type: 18
      value: "Uda\u0142o ci si\u0119 uko\u0144czy\u0107 misj\u0119. Mo\u017Cna j\u0105
        zebra\u0107 z <color=#ffc600>panelu misji</color>."
      baseValue: You have completed a mission. It can be collected from the <color=#ffc600>Mission
        Panel</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jXjkzH27
      type: 18
      value: "Podle\u0107 do statku-matki i naci\u015Bnij przycisk <color=#ffc600>interakcji</color>,
        by zadokowa\u0107."
      baseValue: Move toward the mothership and press <color=#ffc600>interact</color>
        to dock.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: sfgfxbnx
      type: 18
      value: "Mo\u017Cesz wykonywa\u0107 skok hipernap\u0119dem mi\u0119dzy wydarzeniami,
        by szybciej podr\xF3\u017Cowa\u0107."
      baseValue: You can hyperdrive jump between encounters for faster travel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Xg6o3rEX
      type: 18
      value: "Umie\u015B\u0107 <color=#ffc600>Klucz sektorowy</color> w bramie sektora
        na <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>."
      baseValue: Place the <color=#ffc600>Sector Keystone</color> into the Secor
        Gateway at <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xwPjwzi8
      type: 18
      value: "<color=#ffc600>Odporno\u015B\u0107 tarczy</color> sprawi, \u017Ce tw\xF3j
        statek b\u0119dzie odporny na os\u0142abienia danego typu."
      baseValue: <color=#ffc600>Shield Resistance</color> will make you immune to
        debuffs of that type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: r6IBC7w9
      type: 18
      value: "Mo\u017Cesz teraz odblokowa\u0107 dodatkowe miejsce w panelu <color=#ffc600>ulepsze\u0144</color>."
      baseValue: You can now unlock an additional slot in the <color=#ffc600>Upgrades</color>
        panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hPHo23Bg
      type: 18
      value: "Dodatkowe klasy statk\xF3w s\u0105 dost\u0119pne w <color=#ffc600>edytorze
        statk\xF3w</color> na <color=#ffc600>statku-matce</color>."
      baseValue: Additional ship classes are available in <color=#ffc600>Ship Design</color>
        at the <color=#ffc600>Mothership</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ArqiBaTi
      type: 18
      value: "Mo\u017Cesz powi\u0105za\u0107 miejsca na <color=#DB5656>bro\u0144
        poboczn\u0105</color> i miejsca <color=#7756DB>specjalne</color> w panelu
        wyposa\u017Cenia."
      baseValue: You can link <color=#DB5656>Secondary Weapon</color> and <color=#7756DB>Special</color>
        slots in the equipment panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hmkSTF8r
      type: 18
      value: "Do\u0142adowanie podczas lotu z du\u017C\u0105 pr\u0119dko\u015Bci\u0105
        sprawia, \u017Ce jeste\u015B <color=#DA5F00>niezniszczalny</color> i wy\u0142\u0105cza
        bro\u0144."
      baseValue: Boosting at high speed makes you <color=#DA5F00>invulnerable</color>
        and disables weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vAJLXeSx
      type: 18
      value: "Otw\xF3rz <color=#ffc600>Panel nawigacyjny</color>, aby zlokalizowa\u0107
        Statek monta\u017Cowy na mapie sektor\xF3w."
      baseValue: Open the <color=#ffc600>Navigation Panel</color> to locate the Assembler
        on the sector map.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Yl7Tc7Bv
      type: 18
      value: "Punkty trasy to <color=#ffc600>trwa\u0142e odblokowania</color> i nadal
        mo\u017Cna do nich powr\xF3ci\u0107 po regeneracji sektora."
      baseValue: Waypoints are <color=#ffc600>permanent unlocks</color> and can still
        be jumped to after the sector is regenerated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: FFlVzdh8
      type: 18
      value: "U\u017Cyj <color=#ff441b>Zainfekowanego Ziarna</color> na <color=#ffc600>Punkcie
        trasy</color>, je\u015Bli chcesz walczy\u0107 z wi\u0119ksz\u0105 liczb\u0105
        wrog\xF3w Gatunku XI."
      baseValue: Use the <color=#ff441b>Infected Seed</color> on a <color=#ffc600>Waypoint</color>
        if you want to fight more Species-XI enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
