    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectPiercesShields
      type: 9
      value: Przebija Tarcze
      baseValue: Pierces Shields
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectReactionsHeading
      type: 9
      value: Reakcje
      baseValue: Reactions
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectReactionsIntro
      type: 9
      value: "Gdy wr\xF3g ma jednocze\u015Bnie dwa z tych os\u0142abie\u0144, wyzwala
        si\u0119 reakcja. Oba os\u0142abienia pozostaj\u0105 na\u0142o\u017Cone,
        ale \u017Cadna nowa reakcja nie mo\u017Ce si\u0119 wyzwoli\u0107 na tym wrogu
        przez 1 sekund\u0119. Diagram pokazuje, kt\xF3re pary wyzwalaj\u0105 kt\xF3r\u0105
        reakcj\u0119. Zar\xF3wno obra\u017Cenia, jak i szansa na os\u0142abienie
        przy trafieniach reakcji pochodz\u0105 z broni, kt\xF3ra na\u0142o\u017Cy\u0142a
        wyzwalaj\u0105ce os\u0142abienie, wi\u0119c reakcje mog\u0105 uruchamia\u0107
        kolejne reakcje."
      baseValue: When an enemy carries two of these debuffs at the same time, a reaction
        fires. Both debuffs stay applied, but no reaction can trigger on that enemy
        again for 1 second. The diagram shows which pairs trigger which reaction.
        Both the damage and the debuff chance on a reaction's hits come from the
        weapon that applied the triggering debuff, so reactions can chain into more
        reactions.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
