  - categoryName: Component.StarMapDifficulty
    entries:
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyRelaxedDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Odpr\u0119\u017C si\u0119 i poznaj fabu\u0142\u0119 przy \u0142atwiejszym
        wyzwaniu, gdzie wrogowie s\u0105 s\u0142absi i bardziej wyrozumiali."
      baseValue: Relax and enjoy the story with an easier challenge, where enemies
        are weaker and more forgiving.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyNormalDesc
      type: 8
      value: Zalecane do pierwszej rozgrywki. Umiarkowane wyzwanie podczas poznawania
        gry.
      baseValue: Recommended for your first play through. A moderate challenge as
        you learn about the game.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyChallengingDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Solidne wyzwanie dla do\u015Bwiadczonych graczy gatunku, lubi\u0105cych
        wyzwania od samego pocz\u0105tku."
      baseValue: A solid challenge for experienced players of the game or genre who
        like a challenge from the start.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyFormidableDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Gra\u0142e\u015B w t\u0119 gr\u0119 ju\u017C wiele razy i udoskonala\u0142e\u015B
        swoje konstrukcje metod\u0105 skrupulatnych pr\xF3b i b\u0142\u0119d\xF3w."
      baseValue: You've played this game many times before and have refined your
        builds through meticulous trial and error.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyImpossibleDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Napisa\u0142e\u015B wiele arkuszy kalkulacyjnych na temat tej gry,
        kt\xF3re zawieraj\u0105 skomplikowane r\xF3wnania i zapami\u0119ta\u0142e\u015B
        je."
      baseValue: You've written multiple spreadsheets about this game that include
        complicated equations and memorized them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyCustomDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Jeste\u015B buntownikiem. Nikt nie m\xF3wi ci, jak gra\u0107 w t\u0119
        gr\u0119, wi\u0119c dostosuj ustawienia tak, jak ci si\u0119 podoba."
      baseValue: You're a rebel. Nobody tells you how to play the game so set the
        settings to whatever you damn well please.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
