    - key: HUDChat.chatListedReachable
      type: 10
      value: "Twoja gra jest na publicznej li\u015Bcie gier i przyjmuje bezpo\u015Brednie
        po\u0142\u0105czenia na porcie {0}."
      baseValue: Your game is on the public server list and accepts direct connections
        on port {0}.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatFriendsListedReachable
      type: 10
      value: "Twoja gra jest widoczna dla twoich znajomych Steam i przyjmuje bezpo\u015Brednie
        po\u0142\u0105czenia na porcie {0}."
      baseValue: Your game is visible to your Steam friends and accepts direct connections
        on port {0}.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatPortOpenedBlocked
      type: 10
      value: "Port {0} zosta\u0142 otwarty na twoim routerze, ale nadal nie jest
        osi\u0105galny z internetu - prawdopodobnie blokuje go tw\xF3j dostawca internetu
        lub drugi router."
      baseValue: Port {0} was opened on your router but the internet still cannot
        reach it - your ISP or a second router is probably blocking it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatPortClosedBlocked
      type: 10
      value: "Nie uda\u0142o si\u0119 otworzy\u0107 portu {0} na twoim routerze i
        nie jest on osi\u0105galny z internetu."
      baseValue: Couldn't open port {0} on your router and the internet cannot reach
        it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinSteamAndHelper
      type: 10
      value: "Gracze na Steam nadal mog\u0105 do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 przez Steam,
        a pozostali przez pomocnik po\u0142\u0105cze\u0144 star-vortex.com, ale nikt
        nie mo\u017Ce do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 po adresie IP."
      baseValue: Steam players can still join through Steam and others through the
        star-vortex.com connection helper, but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinSteamOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Gracze na Steam nadal mog\u0105 do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 przez Steam,
        ale pomocnik po\u0142\u0105cze\u0144 star-vortex.com nie odpowiedzia\u0142,
        wi\u0119c nikt inny nie mo\u017Ce do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107."
      baseValue: Steam players can still join through Steam, but the star-vortex.com
        connection helper did not answer, so nobody else can join.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinHelperOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Gracze z publicznej listy gier nadal mog\u0105 do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107
        przez pomocnik po\u0142\u0105cze\u0144 star-vortex.com (dzia\u0142a z wi\u0119kszo\u015Bci\u0105
        router\xF3w), ale nikt nie mo\u017Ce do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 po adresie IP."
      baseValue: Players from the game list can still join through the star-vortex.com
        connection helper (works with most routers), but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinFriendsHelperOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Twoi znajomi Steam nadal mog\u0105 do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 przez pomocnik
        po\u0142\u0105cze\u0144 star-vortex.com (dzia\u0142a z wi\u0119kszo\u015Bci\u0105
        router\xF3w), ale nikt nie mo\u017Ce do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 po adresie IP."
      baseValue: Your Steam friends can still join through the star-vortex.com connection
        helper (works with most routers), but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinNone
      type: 10
      value: "Pomocnik po\u0142\u0105cze\u0144 star-vortex.com r\xF3wnie\u017C nie
        odpowiedzia\u0142, wi\u0119c twoja gra nie trafi\u0142a na publiczn\u0105
        list\u0119 gier i nikt nie mo\u017Ce do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107. Aby to naprawi\u0107,
        przekieruj r\u0119cznie port UDP {0}."
      baseValue: The star-vortex.com connection helper did not answer either, so
        your game could not be listed and nobody can join. Forward UDP port {0} manually
        to fix this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinFriendsNone
      type: 10
      value: "Pomocnik po\u0142\u0105cze\u0144 star-vortex.com r\xF3wnie\u017C nie
        odpowiedzia\u0142, wi\u0119c twoi znajomi Steam nie widz\u0105 twojej gry
        i nikt nie mo\u017Ce do\u0142\u0105czy\u0107. Aby to naprawi\u0107, przekieruj
        r\u0119cznie port UDP {0}."
      baseValue: The star-vortex.com connection helper did not answer either, so
        your Steam friends cannot see your game and nobody can join. Forward UDP
        port {0} manually to fix this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
