      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: WorldController
    entries:
    - key: worldController.introDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Utrzyma\u0107 lini\u0119! Trzyma\u0107 to z dala od Statku-Matki!"
      baseValue: Hold the line! Keep those things off the mothership!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Zbli\u017Ca si\u0119 wi\u0119cej wrog\xF3w. Obecnie ich przewaga liczebna
        wynosi pi\u0119\u0107 do jednego."
      baseValue: More hostiles approaching. They currently outnumber us five to one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "To nie wygl\u0105da dobrze..."
      baseValue: This isn't looking good...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Wykryto anomalny sygna\u0142. To... transponder pochodz\u0105cy z opuszczonego
        statku. Jego odleg\u0142o\u015B\u0107 wynosi... ten zasi\u0119g nie powinien
        by\u0107 mo\u017Cliwy."
      baseValue: Anomalous signal detected. It's... a transponder coming from a derelict
        vessel. Its distance is... this range shouldn't be possible.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.5
      type: 2
      value: "Wrak statku? Jeste\u015B pewien?"
      baseValue: A shipwreck? Are you sure?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.6
      type: 2
      value: "Oczywi\u015Bcie. Si\u0142a sygna\u0142u sugeruje, \u017Ce jest prawdziwy.
        Ale nie powinni\u015Bmy by\u0107 w stanie go wykry\u0107 na tym dystansie."
      baseValue: Positive. Signal strength suggests it's real. But we shouldn't be
        able to detect it at this range.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.7
      type: 2
      value: "Odleg\u0142o\u015B\u0107 jest dobra! Natychmiast ustaw kurs. B\u0119dziemy
        pod\u0105\u017Ca\u0107 za tob\u0105."
      baseValue: Distance is good! Set course immediately. We'll follow your lead.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelNavigationDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Musimy przedosta\u0107 si\u0119 przez ten sektor, aby znale\u017A\u0107
        Klucze sektorowe."
      baseValue: We need to work our way through this sector to find the Sector Keystones.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelNavigationDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Statek mo\u017Ce przeskakiwa\u0107 mi\u0119dzy po\u0142\u0105czonymi
        punktami mapy podczas eksploracji."
      baseValue: The ship can hyperjump between connected encounters as you explore.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Witamy w systemie ulepsze\u0144. Postaraj si\u0119 niczego nie zepsu\u0107."
      baseValue: Welcome to the upgrade system. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Awansuj, aby zdobywa\u0107 punkty ulepsze\u0144. Co 10 poziom\xF3w
        otrzymasz nowy, b\u0142yszcz\u0105cy slot na bro\u0144."
      baseValue: Level up to earn upgrade points. Every 10 levels, you get a shiny
        new weapon slot.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Wi\u0119ksze statki zaczynaj\u0105 si\u0119 odblokowywa\u0107 po 15
        poziomie... zak\u0142adaj\u0105c, \u017Ce prze\u017Cyjesz tak d\u0142ugo."
      baseValue: Bigger ships start to unlock at 15... assuming you survive that
        long.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u017Badne wybory nie s\u0105 trwa\u0142e. Mo\u017Cesz zresetowa\u0107
        wszystko za darmo."
      baseValue: No choices are permanent. You can reset it all for free.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelSlotUnlockedDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Odblokowano nowy slot na bro\u0144. Postaraj si\u0119 go nie zmarnowa\u0107."
      baseValue: New weapon slot unlocked. Try not to waste it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelSlotUnlockedDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "B\u0119dziesz musia\u0142 zadokowa\u0107 do statku-matki, aby zaktualizowa\u0107
        projekt statku. Powstrzymam si\u0119 od oceniania go... g\u0142o\u015Bno."
      baseValue: You'll need to dock with the mothership to update your ship design.
        I'll refrain from judging it... loudly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelIncreaseLevelDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wydaj tu kredyty, aby podnie\u015B\u0107 poziom przedmiotu. Statystyki
        si\u0119 poprawiaj\u0105, wi\u0119c tw\xF3j stary ekwipunek nie zostaje w
        tyle."
      baseValue: Spend credits here to raise an item's level. Stats improve, so yer
        old gear doesn't fall behind.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelIncreaseRarityDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Zwi\u0119ksz rzadko\u015B\u0107 przedmiotu, po\u015Bwi\u0119caj\u0105c
        mocniejszy egzemplarz tego samego rodzaju. Wy\u017Csza rzadko\u015B\u0107
        oznacza wi\u0119cej miejsca na modyfikatory, bez utraty tego, co ju\u017C
        masz."
      baseValue: Boost an item's rarity by sacrificing a stronger one of the same
        kind. Higher rarity means more room for modifiers, without losing what ya've
        already got.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelReplaceModifierDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Dzi\u0119ki temu mo\u017Cesz zdj\u0105\u0107 modyfikator z jednego
        przedmiotu i przenie\u015B\u0107 go na inny. Kosztuje to kredyty i, o ile
        nie jest to schemat, z dawcy zostaje z\u0142om."
      baseValue: This lets ya lift a modifier off one item and stick it on another.
        Costs credits, and unless it's a schematic, the donor's scrap after.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarSkirmishDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Niekt\xF3re z wrogich statk\xF3w zak\u0142\xF3caj\u0105 dzia\u0142anie
        bram. Wyeliminuj te statki, aby kontynuowa\u0107!"
      baseValue: Some of the enemy ships are disrupting the gateways. Eliminate those
        ships to proceed!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarWarzoneDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wielu wrog\xF3w zbli\u017Ca si\u0119 do twojej pozycji. Nie martw si\u0119,
        wy\u015Bl\u0119 posi\u0142ki, aby ci pom\xF3c!"
      baseValue: Multiple enemies closing on your position. Don't worry, I'll send
        reinforcements to assist!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarRescueDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hipernap\u0119d naszego sojusznika jest uszkodzony. Bro\u0144 ich,
        dop\xF3ki nie b\u0119d\u0105 w stanie przywr\xF3ci\u0107 go do dzia\u0142ania!"
      baseValue: Our ally's hyperdrive is damaged. Defend them until they can get
        it back online!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarInterceptDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Przechwycili\u015Bmy grup\u0119 statk\xF3w transportowych przewo\u017C\u0105cych
        cenny \u0142adunek. Zniszcz ich, zanim z nim uciekn\u0105!"
      baseValue: We've intercepted a group of transport ships carrying valuable cargo.
        Destroy them before they escape with it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarTraderDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Statki handlowe takie jak ten nie opowiadaj\u0105 si\u0119 po \u017Cadnej
        ze stron. Nie \u017Ceby\u015Bmy mieli si\u0119 k\u0142\xF3ci\u0107."
      baseValue: Trading vessels like this don't take sides. Not that we're in any
        position to argue.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarEliteDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Eliminuj wrog\xF3w szybko, nadchodzi elitarny przeciwnik."
      baseValue: Eliminate the enemies quickly, an elite foe is incoming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.increaseRarityDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Teraz awansujesz w galaktyce! Przynie\u015B mi sw\xF3j sprz\u0119t,
        a ja zwi\u0119ksz\u0119 jego rzadko\u015B\u0107. Niech b\u0142yszczy!"
      baseValue: Well now, yer movin' up in the galaxy! Bring me yer gear, and I'll
        upgrade it's rarity. Let's make it shine!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.replaceModifierDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Dobra, oto co\u015B nowego. Mog\u0119 teraz przenosi\u0107 modyfikatory
        mi\u0119dzy sprz\u0119tami. B\u0105d\u017Amy kreatywni, co?"
      baseValue: Right, here's something new. I can transfer modifiers between equipment
        now. Let's get creative, eh?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Widoczno\u015B\u0107 jest nieoptymalna. Aktywacja otwor\xF3w wentylacyjnych."
      baseValue: Visibility is suboptimal. Activating exhaust vents.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Znacznie lepiej. Mo\u017Cesz je z powrotem zamkn\u0105\u0107, je\u015Bli
        chcesz je ukry\u0107."
      baseValue: Much better. You can toggle them back closed if you wish to hide.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Jak tch\xF3rz?"
      baseValue: Like a coward?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Nieee, jak drapie\u017Cnik, kt\xF3ry poluje na swoj\u0105 ofiar\u0119!
        Nie mog\u0119 strzela\u0107 z broni ani korzysta\u0107 z boostera bez ich
        otwierania."
      baseValue: Nooo, like a predator, stalking their prey! I can't fire weapons
        or boost without opening them though.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisMoltenAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wykryto stopione asteroidy. Zderzenie spowoduje efekt Po\u017Caru,
        zadaj\u0105c obra\u017Cenia termiczne w czasie i gwa\u0142townie zwi\u0119kszaj\u0105c
        temperatur\u0119 statku. W tym obszarze obra\u017Cenia termiczne s\u0105
        wzmacniane."
      baseValue: Molten asteroids detected. Collision will apply Burning, dealing
        thermal damage over time and rapidly increasing ship heat. Thermal damage
        is amplified in this region.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisFrozenAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Przed nami pole zamarzni\u0119tych szcz\u0105tk\xF3w. Uderzenie mo\u017Ce
        spowodowa\u0107 efekt Zamro\u017Cenia, zmniejszaj\u0105c pr\u0119dko\u015B\u0107
        i moc broni o pi\u0119\u0107dziesi\u0105t procent, a jednocze\u015Bnie szybko
        wysysaj\u0105c ciep\u0142o. W tym obszarze obra\u017Cenia od zimna s\u0105
        zwi\u0119kszone."
      baseValue: Frozen debris field ahead. Impact may inflict Frozen, reducing speed
        and weapon output by fifty percent while draining heat quickly. Cold damage
        is enhanced in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisRadioactiveAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Obecne s\u0105 radioaktywne asteroidy. Zderzenie powoduje kumulacj\u0119
        obra\u017Ce\u0144 radioaktywnych, kt\xF3re omijaj\u0105 os\u0142ony. Unikaj
        powtarzaj\u0105cych si\u0119 uderze\u0144. Obra\u017Cenia od promieniowania
        s\u0105 wzmacniane w tym obszarze."
      baseValue: Radioactive asteroids present. Collision applies stacking Radioactive
        damage that bypasses shields. Avoid repeated impacts. Radiation damage is
        amplified in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisCorrosiveAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wykryto \u017Cr\u0105ce od\u0142amki. Uderzenie powoduje efekt Korozji,
        pozwalaj\u0105c wrogom zadawa\u0107 ci trafienia krytyczne. W tym obszarze
        obra\u017Cenia od korozji s\u0105 zwi\u0119kszone."
      baseValue: Corrosive debris detected. Impact causes Corroding, allowing enemies
        to critical strike you. Corrosive damage is increased in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisInvaderNebulaDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wykryto cz\u0105stki Pustki. Kontakt wywo\u0142a efekt Po\u017Caru,
        zadaj\u0105c obra\u017Cenia termiczne w czasie i zwi\u0119kszaj\u0105c temperatur\u0119.
        Nie przelatuj przez nie niepotrzebnie."
      baseValue: Void particles detected. Contact will trigger Burning, applying
        thermal damage over time and increasing heat. Do not fly through them unnecessarily.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
