  - categoryName: Resource.FixedStar
    entries:
    - key: rYaZS5Ys.name
      type: 5
      value: Alfa Saxa
      baseValue: Alpha Saxa
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.name
      type: 5
      value: Astralis
      baseValue: Astralis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Najwy\u017Cszy czas zobaczy\u0107 przyjazn\u0105 twarz! Gdzie jest
        stary Gid?"
      baseValue: About time I saw a friendly face! Where's ol' Gid?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Novus Prime... Wy\u015Bl\u0119 ci wsp\xF3\u0142rz\u0119dne."
      baseValue: Novus Prime... I'll send you the coordinates.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Hipernap\u0119d dzia\u0142a... cholerstwo ma w\u0142asny umys\u0142.
        B\u0119d\u0119 potrzebowa\u0142 troch\u0119 czasu. Trzymaj tych wrog\xF3w
        z dala ode mnie, dobrze?"
      baseValue: Hyperdrive's actin' up... bloody thing's got a mind of its own.
        I'll need a wee bit o' time. Keep those hostiles off me, will ya?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.name
      type: 5
      value: Avalon
      baseValue: Avalon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wasza inwazja ko\u0144czy si\u0119 tutaj. Jeste\u015Bcie absolutnie
        bez szans!"
      baseValue: Your incursion ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nie by\u0142bym tego taki pewien."
      baseValue: I wouldn't be so sure about that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Wszystkie statki, skupi\u0107 ogie\u0144 na Cytadeli. To ko\u0144czy
        si\u0119 tutaj!"
      baseValue: All ships, focus fire on the Citadel. This ends here!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Kad\u0142ub zaraz p\u0119knie. Ewakuuj\u0119 za\u0142og\u0119... Teraz
        wszystko zale\u017Cy od ciebie."
      baseValue: Hull's about to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you
        now.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Dobra robota. Teraz umie\u015B\u0107 ten klucz sektorowy w bramie sektorowej.
        Jeszcze nie sko\u0144czyli\u015Bmy!"
      baseValue: Good work. Now, go place that keystone in the sector gateway. We're
        not done yet!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.name
      type: 5
      value: Infernum
      baseValue: Infernum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "To du\u017Cy w\u0105\u017C..."
      baseValue: That's a big snake...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Oszcz\u0119dz\u0119 ci oczywistego \u017Cartu..."
      baseValue: I'll spare you the obvious joke...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.name
      type: 5
      value: Zmrok
      baseValue: Nightfall
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Cholerni kulty\u015Bci. Za\u0142o\u017C\u0119 si\u0119, \u017Ce wierz\u0105
        w kosmit\xF3w."
      baseValue: Damn cultists. I bet they believe in aliens.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Przegapi\u0142e\u015B wszystkich kosmit\xF3w, z kt\xF3rymi walczyli\u015Bmy?"
      baseValue: Did you miss all the aliens we've been fighting?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Zapomnienie jest wspomnieniem z przysz\u0142o\u015Bci!"
      baseValue: Forgotten are the memories of the future!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Niewa\u017Cne. Po prostu nie pij \u017Cadnego z ich Kool-Aid."
      baseValue: Whatever. Just don't drink any of their Kool-Aid.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: gkWSs2X1.name
      type: 5
      value: Novus Prime
      baseValue: Novus Prime
