      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.name
      type: 5
      value: Ukojenie
      baseValue: Serenity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nie mo\u017Cesz odebra\u0107 mi nieba!"
      baseValue: You can't take the sky from me!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "O czym ty m\xF3wisz?"
      baseValue: What are you talking about?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Po prostu co\u015B z jednego z seriali telewizyjnych, kt\xF3re trzyma\u0142em."
      baseValue: Just something from one of the TV series I kept.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Poka\u017C\u0119 ci \u015Bwiat bez grzechu."
      baseValue: I'm going to show you a world without sin.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Widzisz? Dosta\u0142 odniesienie..."
      baseValue: See? He got the reference...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.name
      type: 5
      value: Virenum
      baseValue: Virenum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Wykrywam niebezpiecznie wysoki poziom promieniowania.
      baseValue: I'm detecting dangerously high levels of radiation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Czy nie jest to po prostu przestrze\u0144 w og\xF3le?"
      baseValue: Isn't that just space in general?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "To wi\u0119cej ni\u017C normalnie. Ten statek wsz\u0119dzie przecieka."
      baseValue: This is higher than normal. That ship is leaking it everywhere.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\u015Awietnie. W\u0142a\u015Bnie tego potrzebowali\u015Bmy..."
      baseValue: Great. Just what we needed...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: R2NUkvrp.name
      type: 5
      value: Punkt trasy Alpha
      baseValue: Waypoint Alpha
