    - key: T748amiF.name
      type: 5
      value: Bastion
      baseValue: Bastion
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Statek Konklawe... nieoczekiwane. Czy przyjdziesz zobaczy\u0107, jak
        naprawd\u0119 wygl\u0105da wolno\u015B\u0107?"
      baseValue: A Conclave ship... unexpected. Do you come to see what freedom truly
        looks like?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Przyjd\u0119 tam, gdzie musz\u0119."
      baseValue: I go where I need to.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nast\u0119pnie dobrze si\u0119 przyjrzyj. Tego w\u0142a\u015Bnie obawia
        si\u0119 Konklawe, tego, czego nigdy nie b\u0119dzie w stanie kontrolowa\u0107."
      baseValue: Then take a good look. This is what the Conclave fears, what it
        could never control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Lubi\u0119 tych facet\xF3w..."
      baseValue: I kind of like these guys...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.name
      type: 5
      value: "Bifr\xF6st"
      baseValue: "Bifr\xF6st"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Och, sp\xF3jrz! Podw\xF3jne k\u0142opoty. Para \u0142\u0105czy si\u0142y...
        tak jak my!"
      baseValue: Oh, look! Double trouble. A pair teaming up... just like us!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Zastanawiam si\u0119, kt\xF3ry z nich jest m\xF3zgiem..."
      baseValue: I wonder which one is the brains...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: W48tqWIi.name
      type: 5
      value: Genesis
      baseValue: Genesis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.name
      type: 5
      value: Nilfheim
      baseValue: Nilfheim
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Szar\u017Cujesz w kierunku Pryzmatu jak wszyscy zdobywcy przed tob\u0105...
        \u015Blepy na to, czego nie rozumiesz."
      baseValue: You charge toward the Prism like all conquerors before you... blind
        to what you do not understand.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Przepraszamy za op\xF3\u017Anienie..."
      baseValue: Apologies for the delay...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Jeszcze raz do wy\u0142omu, wszystkie statki \u0142\u0105cz\u0105 si\u0119!"
      baseValue: Once more unto the breach, all ships engage!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nie wytrzymamy ju\u017C d\u0142ugo. Wycofuj\u0119 si\u0119. Nie pozw\xF3l,
        \u017Ceby to wszystko posz\u0142o na marne."
      baseValue: We won't hold together much longer. I'm pulling back. Don't let
        this be for nothing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Kolejny wr\xF3g pokonany. Dobra robota. Za\u0142adujmy bram\u0119 sektorow\u0105."
      baseValue: Another enemy vanquished. Well done. Let's get that sector gateway
        charged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Jeszcze tylko jeden sektor dzieli nas od Ziemi.
      baseValue: Only one more sector stands between us and Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Sektor pe\u0142en ro\u015Blin..."
      baseValue: A sector full of plants...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ro\u015Bliny? No tak, flora... \u015Bliczna..."
      baseValue: Plants? Oh right, the Flora... lovely...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: LNahHPg9.name
      type: 5
      value: Tartarus
      baseValue: Tartarus
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: LNahHPg9.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Sekrety Fantoma s\u0105 teraz nasze. Odejd\u017A... lub zosta\u0144
        pochowany razem z nimi."
      baseValue: The Phantom's secrets are ours now. Leave... or be buried with them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.name
      type: 5
      value: Vanaheimr
      baseValue: Vanaheimr
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Obszar ten charakteryzuje si\u0119 niezwykle wysokim napi\u0119ciem..."
      baseValue: This area has an unusually high voltage about it...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Co to dok\u0142adnie oznacza?"
      baseValue: And that means what, exactly?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Je\u015Bli os\u0142ony spadn\u0105 wystarczaj\u0105co d\u0142ugo, mo\u017Cemy
        na\u0142adowa\u0107 ten stary odtwarzacz MP3."
      baseValue: If the shields drop long enough, we can recharge that old MP3 player.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
