    - key: Dlbb7rr7.name
      type: 5
      value: Cindros
      baseValue: Cindros
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Dlbb7rr7.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Tutaj ko\u0144czy si\u0119 twoja \u015Bcie\u017Cka. Galaktyka nale\u017Cy
        do tych, kt\xF3rzy maj\u0105 si\u0142\u0119, by napisa\u0107 j\u0105 na nowo."
      baseValue: This is where your path ends. The galaxy belongs to those with the
        strength to rewrite it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lALYBu7d.name
      type: 5
      value: Crypsis
      baseValue: Crypsis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lALYBu7d.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Tw\xF3j op\xF3r jest nielogiczny. Poddaj si\u0119 teraz, aby zachowa\u0107
        optymaln\u0105 ochron\u0119."
      baseValue: Your defiance is illogical. Surrender now for optimal preservation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YwqQzBs8.name
      type: 5
      value: Eden
      baseValue: Eden
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
