      baseValue: Necrosia
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2tYduHEy.name
      type: 5
      value: Petralis
      baseValue: Petralis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2tYduHEy.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ta rzecz \u015Bwieci si\u0119 jak nawiedzona choinka..."
      baseValue: That thing's glowing like a haunted Christmas tree...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2tYduHEy.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "My\u015Blisz, \u017Ce jest ju\u017C za p\xF3\u017Ano na zwrot i odzyskanie
        pieni\u0119dzy?"
      baseValue: Think it's too late to return it and get store credit?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CDZ5eoo7.name
      type: 5
      value: Sylvara
      baseValue: Sylvara
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZIZW21Vn.name
      type: 5
      value: Thornix
      baseValue: Thornix
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZIZW21Vn.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Oooo, tu jest inny kolor!
      baseValue: Oooo, this one's a different color!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZIZW21Vn.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Jest czerwony, ESA. Kiedy czerwony kolor oznacza\u0142 co\u015B dobrego?"
      baseValue: It's red, ESA. When has red ever meant 'good'?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZIZW21Vn.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Salsa jest czerwona. Fajitas potrzebuj\u0105 salsy. Odpoczywam."
      baseValue: Salsa is red. Fajitas need salsa. I rest my case.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VaQoeakc.name
      type: 5
      value: Verdara
      baseValue: Verdara
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VaQoeakc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bez wzgl\u0119du na wynik, tw\xF3j koniec jest pewny. Je\u015Bli nie
        przez nasze ciernie, to przez tego, kt\xF3ry podsyca pustk\u0119."
      baseValue: No matter the outcome, your end is certain. If not by our thorns,
        then by the one who stirs the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VaQoeakc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Gid rozmawia z Wielkim Marsza\u0142kiem, wi\u0119c jestem twoim wsparciem.
        Nie martw si\u0119, przynios\u0142em przek\u0105ski i materia\u0142y wybuchowe."
      baseValue: Gid's chatting to the Grand Marshal, so I'm your backup. Don't worry,
        I brought snacks and explosives.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VaQoeakc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nie znios\u0119 tego d\u0142u\u017Cej! Wycofuj\u0119 si\u0119... niech
        to ma jakie\u015B znaczenie!"
      baseValue: Can't take much more o' this! I'm withdrawin'... make it count!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
