    - key: hNbAQ7Zj.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Na pok\u0142adzie tego wrogiego statku znajduje si\u0119 wi\u0119cej
        statk\xF3w, jak jeden z tych..."
      baseValue: This enemy ship has more ships inside it, like one of those...
