    - key: x4GIvJUI.name
      type: 5
      value: Lumenveil
      baseValue: Lumenveil
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nawet Flora, tak zdesperowana, by chroni\u0107 natur\u0119, trzyma\u0142a
        si\u0119 relikt\xF3w, kt\xF3re ledwo rozumia\u0142a."
      baseValue: Even the Flora, so desperate to preserve nature, clung to relics
        they barely comprehended.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: ','
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Kolejny kawa\u0142ek twierdzi\u0142... projekt staje si\u0119 coraz
        wyra\u017Aniejszy z ka\u017Cdym kolejnym."
      baseValue: Another piece claimed... the design grows clearer with each one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.name
      type: 5
      value: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Znowu ty... Po co zbierasz te cz\u0119\u015Bci?"
      baseValue: You again... What are you collecting these parts for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: ','
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "To nie jest technologia Fantom\xF3w. Zosta\u0142a stworzona przez Architekt\xF3w...
        tych, kt\xF3rzy zasiali \u017Cycie w gwiazdach."
      baseValue: This isn't Phantom technology. It was crafted by the Architects...
        the ones who seeded life across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Zanim stracili sw\xF3j cel... i znikn\u0119li we w\u0142asnym \u015Bwietle."
      baseValue: Before they lost their purpose... and vanished into their own light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Domagam si\u0119 tego dla wy\u017Cszego celu. Kiedy nadejdzie czas,
        zobaczysz."
      baseValue: I'm claiming it for a higher purpose. When the time comes you will
        see.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
