    - key: faction.Conclave.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Ostatnie wielkie ludzkie imperium, zjednoczone pod w\u0142adz\u0105
        Cesarza po wojnach planetarnych, kt\xF3re niemal zniszczy\u0142y ludzko\u015B\u0107.
        Jego militarystyczny rz\u0105d ceni porz\u0105dek, stabilno\u015B\u0107 i
        si\u0142\u0119 ponad wszystko. Obywatele wiod\u0105 dostatnie \u017Cycie
        wspierane przez zaawansowan\u0105 SI i automatyzacj\u0119, a s\u0142u\u017Cba
        wojskowa jest obowi\u0105zkowa dla ka\u017Cdego doros\u0142ego. Konklawe
        postrzega siebie jako tarcz\u0119 ludzko\u015Bci przed wrog\u0105 galaktyk\u0105."
      baseValue: "The last great human empire, unified under the Emperor after the
        planetary wars nearly wiped humanity out. Its militaristic government values
        order, stability, and strength above all else. Citizens live prosperous lives
        supported by advanced AI and automation, with mandatory military service
        for every adult. The Conclave sees itself as humanity\u2019s shield against
        a hostile galaxy."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Skeran.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Brutalna rasa nap\u0119dzana podbojem, hierarchi\u0105 i nieustann\u0105
        ekspansj\u0105. Ich floty mia\u017Cd\u017C\u0105 wrog\xF3w czyst\u0105 agresj\u0105
        i przyt\u0142aczaj\u0105c\u0105 liczebno\u015Bci\u0105. Skeranie zostali
        pierwotnie stworzeni i manipulowani przez Fantom\xF3w jako \u017Cywa bro\u0144.
        Niezliczone l\u0119gi wci\u0105\u017C pozostaj\u0105 ukryte poza zbadan\u0105
        przestrzeni\u0105."
      baseValue: A brutal race driven by conquest, hierarchy, and endless expansion.
        Their fleets overwhelm enemies through sheer aggression and overwhelming
        numbers. The Skeran were originally created and manipulated by the Phantoms
        as living weapons. Countless broods still remain hidden beyond explored space.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Phantom.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Staro\u017Cytny i wysoce zaawansowany gatunek, kt\xF3ry postrzega m\u0142odsze
        cywilizacje jako prymitywne i autodestrukcyjne. Gardz\u0105 militaryzmem
        Konklawe, a faworyzuj\u0105 Panteon za jego dyplomacj\u0119. Fantomy s\u0105
        skryte, manipuluj\u0105ce i cierpliwe ponad zrozumienie \u015Bmiertelnik\xF3w.
        Wiele cierpie\u0144 galaktyki mo\u017Cna powi\u0105za\u0107 z ich ingerencj\u0105."
      baseValue: "An ancient and highly advanced species that views younger civilizations
        as primitive and self-destructive. They despise the Conclave\u2019s militarism
        and favor the Pantheon for its diplomacy. The Phantoms are secretive, manipulative,
        and patient beyond mortal understanding. Much of the galaxy\u2019s suffering
        can be traced back to their interference."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Flora.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "\u015Awiadomy gatunek ro\u015Blinny, kt\xF3ry ewoluowa\u0142 niezale\u017Cnie
        od \u017Cycia zwierz\u0119cego w Sektorze 3. Postrzegaj\u0105 cywilizacje
        oparte na zwierz\u0119tach jako brutalnych paso\u017Cyt\xF3w wypaczaj\u0105cych
        naturalny porz\u0105dek. Zaci\u0119cie chroni\u0105c swojego terytorium,
        Flora odpowiada agresywnie na wszelkie wtargni\u0119cia w ich \u015Bwiaty.
        Dla nich przemys\u0142 i ekspansja to choroby, kt\xF3re ostatecznie musz\u0105
        zosta\u0107 wyt\u0119pione."
      baseValue: A sentient plant species that evolved independently from animal
        life within Sector 3. They see animal-based civilizations as violent parasites
        corrupting the natural order. Fiercely protective of their territory, the
        Flora respond aggressively to any intrusion into their worlds. To them, industry
        and expansion are diseases that must eventually be purged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Species-XI.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Przera\u017Caj\u0105ce istoty z pustki za bramami. Rozprzestrzeniaj\u0105
        si\u0119 jak zaraza, wypaczaj\u0105c statki, technologi\u0119 i \u017Cywe
        stworzenia. Po prostu pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 i zaczynaj\u0105 niszczy\u0107
        wszystko na swojej drodze, a \u017Cadne pr\xF3by komunikacji nigdy nie zosta\u0142y
        zaobserwowane. Niewiele wiadomo o ich prawdziwej naturze, gdy\u017C wi\u0119kszo\u015B\u0107
        spotka\u0144 ko\u0144czy si\u0119 ca\u0142kowit\u0105 zag\u0142ad\u0105."
      baseValue: Horrific entities from the void beyond the gateways. They spread
        like an infection, corrupting ships, technology, and living creatures. They
        simply appear and begin destroying everything in their path, with no attempts
        at communication ever observed. Very little is understood about their true
        nature, as most encounters end in total annihilation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Grays.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Tajemniczy obcy op\u0119tani genetycznymi eksperymentami i biologiczn\u0105
        perfekcj\u0105. Unikaj\u0105 otwartej wojny, polegaj\u0105c zamiast tego
        na uprowadzeniach, obserwacji i ukrytej manipulacji. Spotkania z Szarakami
        s\u0105 rzadkie, kliniczne i g\u0142\u0119boko niepokoj\u0105ce, a ofiary
        cz\u0119sto znikaj\u0105 bez wyja\u015Bnienia. Wi\u0119kszo\u015B\u0107 cywilizacji
        odrzuca opowie\u015Bci o nich jako teorie spiskowe, dop\xF3ki same nie zostan\u0105
        porwane."
      baseValue: Mysterious extraterrestrials obsessed with genetic experimentation
        and biological perfection. They avoid open warfare, instead relying on abductions,
        observation, and covert manipulation. Encounters with the Grays are rare,
        clinical, and deeply unsettling, with victims often disappearing without
        explanation. Most civilizations dismiss stories about them as conspiracy
        theories until they are taken themselves.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Neutral.backstory
      type: 8
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Forgotten.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Renegacka frakcja Fantom\xF3w, kt\xF3ra odrzuci\u0142a upadek swojego
        gatunku i zamiast tego obj\u0119\u0142a dominacj\u0119. Uwa\u017Caj\u0105
        si\u0119 za wy\u017Cszych od wszelkiego innego \u017Cycia i d\u0105\u017C\u0105
        do zniewolenia s\u0142abszych cywilizacji. Zapomniani otwarcie ingeruj\u0105
        w m\u0142odsze rasy i manipuluj\u0105 nimi, gdziekolwiek je znajd\u0105.
        Ich \u015Bwiaty s\u0105 wype\u0142nione staro\u017Cytn\u0105 technologi\u0105
        wypaczon\u0105 w narz\u0119dzia kontroli."
      baseValue: A rogue faction of Phantoms who rejected the decline of their species
        and embraced domination instead. They believe themselves superior to all
        other life and seek to enslave weaker civilizations. The Forgotten openly
        interfere with and manipulate younger races wherever they find them. Their
        worlds are filled with ancient technology twisted into tools of control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Shadow.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Wyspecjalizowane jednostki infiltracyjne Skeran stworzone przez Fantom\xF3w
        do sabota\u017Cu i tajnej wojny. Uderzaj\u0105 z ciemno\u015Bci, urz\u0105dzaj\u0105c
        zasadzki i kradn\u0105c technologi\u0119, by potem ponownie znikn\u0105\u0107.
        Ich statki s\u0105 szybkie, drapie\u017Cne i zaprojektowane tak, by szerzy\u0107
        strach na r\xF3wni ze zniszczeniem. Nawet pozostali Skeranie odnosz\u0105
        si\u0119 do nich z niepokojem."
      baseValue: Specialized Skeran infiltration units created by the Phantoms for
        sabotage and covert warfare. They strike from darkness, ambushing targets
        and stealing technology before disappearing again. Their ships are fast,
        predatory, and designed to spread fear as much as destruction. Even other
        Skeran regard them with unease.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Junker.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Piraci, dezerterzy i padlino\u017Cercy \u017Cyj\u0105cy w stopionych
        pasach asteroid Sektora 1. Wi\u0119kszo\u015B\u0107 z nich to byli obywatele
        Konklawe, kt\xF3rzy porzucili \u017Cycie wojskowe i obecnie utrzymuj\u0105
        si\u0119 z napad\xF3w i przemytu. Ich statki s\u0105 sk\u0142adane ze skradzionej
        i odzyskanej technologii utrzymywanej w ca\u0142o\u015Bci jedynie dzi\u0119ki
        desperacji. Na terytorium Junkers\xF3w przetrwanie liczy si\u0119 bardziej
        ni\u017C lojalno\u015B\u0107 czy prawo."
      baseValue: Pirates, deserters, and scavengers living within the molten asteroid
        belts of Sector 1. Most are former Conclave citizens who abandoned military
        life and now survive through raiding and smuggling. Their ships are assembled
        from stolen and salvaged technology held together through desperation. In
        Junker territory, survival matters more than loyalty or law.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Outcast.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Ludzie doprowadzeni do szale\u0144stwa przez nadmierne korzystanie
        z eksperymentalnych technologii, takich jak Nap\u0119dy czasowe. Ich umys\u0142y
        zosta\u0142y rozbite do tego stopnia, \u017Ce uwa\u017Caj\u0105 si\u0119
        za o\u015Bwieconych, obdarowanych prawdami, kt\xF3rych reszta ludzko\u015Bci
        nie potrafi poj\u0105\u0107. Ich statki poruszaj\u0105 si\u0119 w walce nieprzewidywalnie,
        fazuj\u0105c i wypaczaj\u0105c sam czas. Nawet Konklawe boi si\u0119 tego,
        czym stali si\u0119 Wyrzutkowie."
      baseValue: Humans driven mad through overuse of experimental technologies such
        as Temporal Drives. Their minds have fractured to the point that they believe
        themselves enlightened, gifted with truths the rest of humanity cannot grasp.
        Their ships move unpredictably through combat, phasing and distorting time
        itself. Even the Conclave fears what the Outcasts have become.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Pantheon.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Potomkowie dezerter\xF3w Konklawe, kt\xF3rzy uciekli z Ziemi, aby zbudowa\u0107
        demokratyczne spo\u0142ecze\u0144stwo wolne od cesarskich rz\u0105d\xF3w.
        Wierz\u0105, \u017Ce Konklawe sta\u0142o si\u0119 obsesyjnie zafiksowane
        na wojnie i kontroli, po\u015Bwi\u0119caj\u0105c przy tym przysz\u0142o\u015B\u0107
        ludzko\u015Bci. Ich pokojowe idea\u0142y zaowocowa\u0142y sojuszem ze staro\u017Cytnymi
        Fantomami, daj\u0105c im dost\u0119p do pot\u0119\u017Cnej technologii. Panteon
        postrzega siebie jako przysz\u0142o\u015B\u0107 ludzko\u015Bci."
      baseValue: "Descendants of Conclave defectors who fled Earth to build a democratic
        society free from imperial rule. They believe the Conclave has become obsessed
        with war and control, sacrificing humanity\u2019s future in the process.
        Their peaceful ideals earned them an alliance with the ancient Phantoms,
        granting access to powerful technology. The Pantheon sees itself as the future
        of mankind."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Sentinel.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Elitarni obro\u0144cy Ziemi i osobiste si\u0142y wojskowe Cesarza.
        S\u0142u\u017C\u0105 bezpo\u015Brednio pod dow\xF3dztwem Wielkiego Marsza\u0142ka
        Vexa, pe\u0142ni\u0105c rol\u0119 gwardii cesarskiej. Ich floty s\u0105 ci\u0119\u017Cko
        uzbrojone, zdyscyplinowane i ca\u0142kowicie bezlitosne w walce. Przybycie
        si\u0142 Wartownik\xF3w zazwyczaj oznacza, \u017Ce sytuacja sta\u0142a si\u0119
        ju\u017C krytyczna."
      baseValue: "Elite defenders of Earth and the Emperor\u2019s personal military
        forces. They serve directly under Grand Marshal Vex, acting as royal guard.
        Their fleets are heavily armed, disciplined, and completely unforgiving in
        battle. The arrival of Sentinel forces usually means the situation has already
        become critical."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog1
      type: 2
      value: "Wreszcie! \u0141adujemy hipernap\u0119d, pom\xF3\u017Ccie ich powstrzyma\u0107!"
      baseValue: Finally! We're charging the hyperdrive, help hold them off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog2
      type: 2
      value: "Dzi\u0119ki Imperatorowi. Wydostaniemy si\u0119 st\u0105d w mgnieniu
        oka, tylko ich powstrzymaj!"
      baseValue: Thank the Emperor. We'll be out of here in no time just hold them
        off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog3
      type: 2
      value: "Nadchodzi wi\u0119cej wrog\xF3w. Uwa\u017Caj!"
      baseValue: We have more hostiles incoming. Watch out!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog4
      type: 2
      value: "Szykuj\u0105 si\u0119 do wi\u0119kszego ataku. Przygotuj si\u0119!"
      baseValue: They're gearing up for a bigger attack. Get ready!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wtargn\u0105\u0142e\u015B w przestrze\u0144 Skeran. Odejd\u017A teraz
        albo zostaniesz zniszczony!"
      baseValue: You are trespassing in Skeran space. Leave now, or be destroyed!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Prosto do pogr\xF3\u017Cek. Urocze."
      baseValue: Straight to the threats. Charming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Oni nie blefuj\u0105."
      baseValue: They're not bluffing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nie, raczej nie. Przygotuj si\u0119..."
      baseValue: No, they're not. Get ready...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Imponuj\u0105ce. Uda\u0142o ci si\u0119 dotrze\u0107 tak daleko, ale
        b\u0119dziesz musia\u0142 walczy\u0107 jeszcze ci\u0119\u017Cej, by dotrze\u0107
        na Ziemi\u0119."
      baseValue: Impressive. You've fought your way this far, but you'll need to
        fight harder to reach Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Uznaj to za dow\xF3d mojego... wsparcia."
      baseValue: Consider this a token of my... support.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.2
      type: 2
      value: Dlaczego? Czemu nam pomagasz?
      baseValue: Why? Why help us?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Pomoc? Nie. Zarz\u0105dzam zmienn\u0105. Tak si\u0119 sk\u0142ada,
        \u017Ce ty na tym korzystasz."
      baseValue: Help? No. I'm managing a variable. You just happen to benefit.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Masz tylko jedn\u0105 \u015Bcie\u017Ck\u0119. Wywalcz sobier drog\u0119
        naprz\xF3d."
      baseValue: You have only one path. Fight your way forward.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wasze zwyci\u0119stwa nic nie znacz\u0105. My zwyci\u0119\u017Cymy!"
      baseValue: Your wins mean nothing. We will be victorious!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Wydaje si\u0119, \u017Ce nie ma im ko\u0144ca..."
      baseValue: There seems to be no end to them...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "S\u0105 nieust\u0119pliwi, to rasa wojownik\xF3w stworzona do wojny."
      baseValue: They're relentless, a warrior race built for war.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u015Amiesz rzuca\u0107 wyzwanie pot\u0119dze Skeran? Nigdy nie dotrzesz
        do Cytadeli!"
      baseValue: You dare challenge the might of the Skeran? You will never reach
        the Citadel!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "Phantomy nie mog\u0142y nas pokona\u0107, ty te\u017C tego nie zrobisz!"
      baseValue: The Phantoms could not defeat us, neither will you!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "Wielkie s\u0142owa dla rasy, kt\xF3ra wkr\xF3tce przegra kolejn\u0105
        walk\u0119."
      baseValue: Big words for a species about to lose another fight.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Cholera, szykuje si\u0119 zasadzka..."
      baseValue: Damn, an ambush prepare to...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Co... co si\u0119 w\u0142a\u015Bnie sta\u0142o?"
      baseValue: What... what just happened?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "To nawet nie zosta\u0142o zarejestrowane przez nasze czujniki. Jakiego
        rodzaju mocy u\u017Cywa?"
      baseValue: That didn't even register on our sensors. What kind of power is
        she using?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Potraktuj to jako nagrod\u0119 za wybranie trudniejszej \u015Bcie\u017Cki."
      baseValue: Take this as a reward for choosing the harder path.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.4
      type: 2
      value: Dlaczego to robisz?
      baseValue: Why are you doing this?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Powiedzmy, \u017Ce ta \u015Bcie\u017Cka przynosi korzy\u015Bci nam
        obojgu."
      baseValue: Let's just say this path benefits us both.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "Naprawd\u0119 oczekujesz, \u017Ce temu zaufamy?"
      baseValue: You really expect us to trust that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.7
      type: 2
      value: "Zaufanie? Nie. Ale nast\u0119pny krok jest jasny. Droga do domu jest
        usiana wrogami, a do przetrwania b\u0119dziesz potrzebowa\u0107 czego\u015B
        wi\u0119cej ni\u017C tylko pyta\u0144."
      baseValue: Trust? No. But the next step is clear. Your way home is littered
        with enemies, and you'll need more than questions to survive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Konklawe powraca, trzymaj\u0105c si\u0119 swoich starych sposob\xF3w.
        Czy kiedykolwiek si\u0119 nauczysz?"
      baseValue: The Conclave returns, clinging to its old ways. Will you ever learn?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Fantomy s\u0105 dok\u0142adnie tym, czego mo\u017Cna oczekiwa\u0107
        od nie\u015Bmiertelnej rasy. Aroganckie, protekcjonalne... lubuj\u0105ce
        si\u0119 w monologach."
      baseValue: Phantoms are exactly what you'd expect from an immortal race. Arrogant,
        condescending... fond of monologues.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nie do ko\u0144ca zapraszaj\u0105 nas na herbat\u0119, prawda?"
      baseValue: Not exactly inviting us to tea, are they?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Wasz gatunek zna tylko wojn\u0119. Nie pozwolimy ci jej tu sprowadzi\u0107."
      baseValue: Your kind knows only war. We will not let you bring it here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ci, kt\xF3rzy zbudowali bramy, nigdy nie rozumieli cierpienia, jakie
        przynios\u0105."
      baseValue: The ones who built the gateways never understood the suffering they'd
        bring.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Cierpienie? Od bram?
      baseValue: Suffering? From the Gateways?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Przeszukali gwiazdy i znale\u017Ali tylko cisz\u0119... wi\u0119c stworzyli
        \u017Cycie, aby wype\u0142ni\u0107 pustk\u0119."
      baseValue: They scoured the stars and found only silence... so they made life
        to fill the emptiness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ale ich cenne bramy roz\u015Bwietli\u0142y pustk\u0119... o\u015Blepiaj\u0105c
        to, co nigdy nie powinno ujrze\u0107 \u015Bwiat\u0142a."
      baseValue: But their precious gateways lit up the void... blinding what should
        never have seen the light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Widzieli\u015Bmy, jak niezliczone cywilizacje powstawa\u0142y i upada\u0142y,
        a ich prochy rozsypywa\u0142y si\u0119 pomi\u0119dzy gwiazdami."
      baseValue: We have seen countless civilizations rise and fall, their ashes
        scattered across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Konklawe nie b\u0119dzie inne."
      baseValue: The Conclave will be no different.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Brzmisz, jakby\u015B by\u0142 tu od zawsze."
      baseValue: You sound like you've been around forever.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Obserwowali\u015Bmy narodziny i \u015Bmier\u0107 gwiazd, upadek tyran\xF3w,
        kt\xF3rzy uwa\u017Cali si\u0119 za wiecznych."
      baseValue: We have watched the birth and death of stars, the fall of tyrants
        who thought themselves eternal.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.4
      type: 2
      value: "Nie my\u015Bl, \u017Ce z\u0142amiesz nas tak \u0142atwo, jak nasze
        niepos\u0142uszne zwierzaki."
      baseValue: Do not think you will break us as easily as you did our disobedient
        pets.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.5
      type: 2
      value: "Nast\u0119pnie umie\u015B\u0107 nas na swojej li\u015Bcie upad\u0142ych...
        i obserwuj, co b\u0119dzie dalej."
      baseValue: Then put us on your list of fallen... and watch what happens next.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "B\u0119dziesz tego potrzebowa\u0107."
      baseValue: You'll need this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Czemu?
      baseValue: Why?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "To nie jest cz\u0119\u015B\u0107, w kt\xF3rej umierasz. Na to przyjdzie
        czas p\xF3\u017Aniej."
      baseValue: This isn't the part where you die. That comes later.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Zachwycaj\u0105ce..."
      baseValue: Delightful...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Przynajmniej nie m\xF3wi ju\u017C zagadkami!"
      baseValue: At least it's not speaking in riddles anymore!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "Dzier\u017Cysz w\u0142adz\u0119, nie rozumiej\u0105c jej koszt\xF3w."
      baseValue: You wield power without understanding its cost.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.1
      type: 2
      value: "Do tej pory poradzili\u015Bmy sobie ze wszystkim, co na nas rzucili\u015Bcie."
      baseValue: We've handled everything you've thrown at us so far.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.2
      type: 2
      value: "Tylko dlatego, \u017Ce na to pozwalamy!"
      baseValue: Only because we allow it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.3
      type: 2
      value: "Skeranie byli naszym dzie\u0142em... by\u0142y te\u017C inne, o wiele
        wi\u0119ksze, zapomniane przez czas."
      baseValue: The Skeran were our creations... there were others, far greater,
        lost to time
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.4
      type: 2
      value: "Walczysz o kontrol\u0119 nad galaktyk\u0105, kt\xF3r\u0105 ukszta\u0142towali\u015Bmy,
        nigdy nie kwestionuj\u0105c ruin pod twoimi stopami."
      baseValue: You fight for control of a galaxy we shaped, never questioning the
        ruins beneath your feet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Zawr\xF3\u0107, zwierz\u0119ciu. Nie przyprowadzaj tu Przywo\u0142ywacza
        Pustki."
      baseValue: Turn back, animal. Do not bring the Void Caller here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "A kto to w\u0142a\u015Bciwie jest?"
      baseValue: And who exactly is that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Jej s\u0142ugi \u015Bcigaj\u0105 ci\u0119 nawet teraz. Usuniemy ci\u0119,
        zanim przyb\u0119d\u0105."
      baseValue: Her minions pursue you even now. We will remove you before they
        arrive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Znalaz\u0142em to."
      baseValue: I found this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Znowu nam pomagasz?
      baseValue: Oh, you're helping us again?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Pogubi\u0142e\u015B si\u0119 w samotno\u015Bci. Razem mo\u017Cemy jeszcze
        poczyni\u0107 post\u0119py."
      baseValue: Alone, you floundered. Together we may yet make progress.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ocenia twoje celowanie, poniewa\u017C jest kiepskie..."
      baseValue: It's judging your aiming because your aiming is bad...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Twe zanieczyszczenie rozprzestrzenia si\u0119 po ca\u0142ym ogrodzie."
      baseValue: Your pollution spreads throughout our garden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Zanieczyszczenia? Mam silniki odrzutowe dzia\u0142aj\u0105ce przy emisji
        niemal 0,5%..."
      baseValue: Pollution? I've got these thrusters running at nearly 0.5% emissions...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "My\u015Bl\u0119, \u017Ce to by\u0142a metafora. My\u015Bla\u0142em,
        \u017Ce je rozumiesz?"
      baseValue: I think that was a metaphor. I thought you understood those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "No tak, to my jeste\u015Bmy zanieczyszczeniem... jasne!"
      baseValue: Oh right, we're the pollution... got it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Statku Konklawe, w\u0142a\u015Bnie zrobi\u0142e\u015B nam dzie\u0144.
        Wy\u0142\u0105cz zasilanie i za\u0142atwmy to szybko."
      baseValue: Conclave ship, you just made our day. Power down and we'll make
        this quick.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.1
      type: 2
      value: Uroczo. Piraci z ambicjami... i zerowym instynktem samozachowawczym.
      baseValue: Lovely. Pirates with ambition... and zero self-preservation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Spalili\u015Bcie nasz\u0105 za\u0142og\u0119. Jeste\u015Bmy tu, by
        si\u0119 odwdzi\u0119czy\u0107... z nawi\u0105zk\u0105."
      baseValue: You torched our crew. We're here to return the favor... with interest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Tylko nie znowu te mi\u0119czaki. Odradzaj\u0105 si\u0119, czy tylko
        rozmna\u017Caj\u0105?"
      baseValue: Not these meatheads again. Do they respawn, or just multiply?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Przeszed\u0142em wczoraj... i wr\xF3ci\u0142em z jutra."
      baseValue: I have walked through yesterday... and returned from tomorrow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Fantastycznie. Temporalni \u0107puni z kompleksem boga."
      baseValue: Fantastic. Temporal junkies with a god complex.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Czego oni w og\xF3le szukaj\u0105?"
      baseValue: What are they even after?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Transcendencji... a mo\u017Ce grupowej sesji medytacyjnej na koniec
        czasu."
      baseValue: Transcendence... or maybe a group meditation session at the end
        of time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Jeste\u015B uwi\u0119ziony w tera\u017Aniejszo\u015Bci... a przysz\u0142o\u015B\u0107
        ju\u017C ci\u0119 nie chce."
      baseValue: You are trapped in the present... and the future no longer wants
        you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "To m\xF3wi Dryf Czasowy. Ich umys\u0142y s\u0105 sko\u0142owane."
      baseValue: That's the Temporal Drift talking. Their minds are scrambled.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "S\u0142yszymy ci\u0119, tykaj\u0105cy duchu! Twoje linearne my\u015Bli
        zdradzaj\u0105 twoj\u0105 s\u0142abo\u015B\u0107!"
      baseValue: We hear you, ticking ghost! Your linear thoughts betray your weakness!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Czekaj... oni mnie s\u0142ysz\u0105? To nie tak powinno dzia\u0142a\u0107."
      baseValue: Wait... they can hear me? That's not how this is supposed to work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Wyszli\u015Bmy poza tw\xF3j czas. Nie mo\u017Cna uchwyci\u0107 tego,
        co ju\u017C si\u0119 wydarzy\u0142o."
      baseValue: We've stepped outside your time. You can't catch what's already
        happened.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "W\u0119drujesz tam, dok\u0105d \u015Bwiat\u0142o nie dociera... i nie
        widzisz tego, co nast\u0119p\u0105pi."
      baseValue: You wander where the light does not reach... and do not see what
        follows.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Krytyczny i niepokoj\u0105cy. W\u0142a\u015Bnie tego oczekiwa\u0142em."
      baseValue: Cryptic and unsettling. Just what I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Polowanie ju\u017C si\u0119 zako\u0144czy\u0142o."
      baseValue: The hunt is already over.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "My\u015Bl\u0119, \u017Ce w ten spos\xF3b chc\u0105 powiedzie\u0107,
        \u017Ce mamy k\u0142opoty."
      baseValue: I think that's their way of saying we're in trouble.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ta wiedza nigdy nie by\u0142a przeznaczona dla ciebie."
      baseValue: This knowledge was never meant for you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Wygl\u0105da na to, \u017Ce szukaj\u0105... prawdopodobnie technologii
        Phantom."
      baseValue: Sounds like they're scavenging... probably Phantom tech.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\u015Awietnie. Wi\u0119cej skradzionej broni do wykorzystania jej przeciwko
        nam."
      baseValue: Great. More stolen weapons to turn against us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Samotny statek... prowadzony na manowce przez si\u0142y, kt\xF3rych
        nie rozumiej\u0105."
      baseValue: A lone ship... led astray by forces beyond their understanding.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Nawet nie wiem, kim jeste\u015B..."
      baseValue: I don't even know who you are...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Oczywi\u015Bcie, \u017Ce nie. Twoi mistrzowie wymazuj\u0105 wiele rzeczy
        z twojej historii."
      baseValue: Of course you don't. Your masters erase many things from your history.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Odeszli\u015Bmy od ich tyranii. Teraz stoimy z prawdziwymi mocami."
      baseValue: We walked away from their tyranny. Now we stand with true powers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Fantomy? Zamieni\u0142e\u015B jednego mistrza na drugiego..."
      baseValue: Phantoms? You traded one master for another...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Mistrz wymaga pos\u0142usze\u0144stwa... mentor dzieli si\u0119 m\u0105dro\u015Bci\u0105."
      baseValue: A master demands obedience... a mentor shares wisdom.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Duch z pustki mo\u017Ce zaprowadzi\u0107 ci\u0119 do domu... ale nie
        dla twojego dobra."
      baseValue: The ghost from the void may lead you home... but not for your sake.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Co wiesz o duchach?
      baseValue: What do you know of ghosts?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nawet najstarsi z nas wiedz\u0105, \u017Ce nale\u017Cy ba\u0107 si\u0119
        ciemno\u015Bci."
      baseValue: That even the oldest among us know to fear the darkness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Wkraczasz w staro\u017Cytne cienie, pionku Konklawe."
      baseValue: You step into ancient shadows, Conclave pawn.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Wi\u0119cej fantom\xF3w? Nie brzmisz jak reszta."
      baseValue: More Phantoms? You don't sound like the rest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nie jeste\u015Bmy ich pozosta\u0142o\u015Bci\u0105. Jeste\u015Bmy ich
        doskona\u0142o\u015Bci\u0105."
      baseValue: We are not their remnants. We are their perfection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ukorz si\u0119, albo zostaniesz zdemontowany."
      baseValue: Kneel, or be unmade.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\u0141a\u0144cuchy swoich pan\xF3w nosisz niczym medale."
      baseValue: You wear your masters' chains like medals.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Lepsze to ni\u017C czczenie ruin upad\u0142ego imperium."
      baseValue: Better than worshipping the ruins of a failed empire.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nie tylko si\u0119 \u0142udz\u0105... s\u0105 nostalgiczni i niebezpieczni."
      baseValue: They're not just deluded... they're nostalgic and dangerous.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nie czcimy przesz\u0142o\u015Bci. Poprawiamy j\u0105."
      baseValue: We do not worship the past. We correct it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ludzkie naczynie. Struktura genetyczna potwierdzona. Przygotowa\u0107
        si\u0119 do zbioru."
      baseValue: Human vessel. Genetic structure confirmed. Prepare for collection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Chwila, czy to... czy naprawd\u0119 zostali\u015Bmy porwani?"
      baseValue: Wait. Is this... are we actually getting abducted?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Szaraki. Oczywi\u015Bcie, \u017Ce to Szaraki. Powinienem by\u0142 wzi\u0105\u0107
        foliowy kapelusz."
      baseValue: Grays. Of course, it's Grays. Should've brought a tinfoil hat.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nie stawiaj oporu. Zgodno\u015B\u0107 zapewnia minimaln\u0105 utrat\u0119
        tkanki."
      baseValue: Do not resist. Compliance ensures minimal tissue loss.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Podmiot nadal nie spe\u0142nia wymog\xF3w. Post\u0119pujemy zgodnie
        z protoko\u0142em wt\xF3rnego powstrzymywania."
      baseValue: Subject remains noncompliant. Proceeding with secondary containment
        protocol.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Chyba nie pr\xF3bujesz mnie na serio porwa\u0107?"
      baseValue: You're not seriously still trying to abduct me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "S\u0105. A s\u0105dz\u0105c po skoku skanera... przynie\u015Bli wi\u0119kszy
        s\u0142oik."
      baseValue: They are. And judging by the scanner spike... they brought a bigger
        jar.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Dopuszczalne uszkodzenia tkanek. Rozpocz\u0119cie zbior\xF3w."
      baseValue: Tissue damage acceptable. Begin harvest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
